"26\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/96/Flag_of_the_United_States_%28DDD-F-416E_specifications%29.svg/120px-Flag_of_the_United_States_%28DDD-F-416E_specifications%29.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"1235\" data-file-height=\"650\" /></span></span></span><hr /></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\" class=\"infobox-subheader\"><div style=\"width:100%; margin:1px; display:inline-table;\">\n<div style=\"display:table-cell; text-align:left; vertical-align:middle; padding:0 0.5em 0 0;width:20%;\" class=\"noprint\">&#8592;&#160;<a href=\"/wiki/2020_United_States_Senate_elections\" title=\"2020 United States Senate elections\">2020</a></div>\n<div style=\"display:table-cell; text-align:center; vertical-align:middle; padding:0 1px;width:60%;\" class=\"\"><b>November 8, 2022<br /><span style=\"font-size: 85%;\">December 6 (<a href=\"/wiki/2022_United_States_Senate_election_in_Georgia#Runoff\" title=\"2022 United States Senate election in Georgia\">Georgia runoff</a>)</span></b></div>\n<div style=\"display:table-cell; text-align:right; vertical-align:middle; padding:0 0 0 0.5em;width:20%;\" class=\"noprint\"><a href=\"/wiki/2024_United_States_Senate_elections\" title=\"2024 United States Senate elections\">2024</a>&#160;&#8594;</div>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\" class=\"infobox-subheader\"><div style=\"width:100%; margin:1px; display:inline-table;\">\n<div style=\"display:table-cell; text-align:left; vertical-align:middle; padding:0 0.5em 0 0;width:35%; text-align:center;\" class=\"noprint\">&#8592;&#160;<a href=\"/wiki/2016_United_States_Senate_elections\" title=\"2016 United States Senate elections\">2016</a></div>\n<div style=\"display:table-cell; text-align:center; vertical-align:middle; padding:0 1px;width:30%;\" class=\"\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/United_States_Senate_Class_3\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"United States Senate Class 3\">Class 3</a></b></div>\n<div style=\"display:table-cell; text-align:right; vertical-align:middle; padding:0 0 0 0.5em;width:35%; text-align:center;\" class=\"noprint\"><a href=\"/wiki/2028_United_States_Senate_elections\" title=\"2028 United States Senate elections\"><i>2028</i></a>&#160;&#8594;</div>\n</div></td></tr><tr><th colspan=\"2\" class=\"infobox-header\"><hr />35<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>a<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> of the 100 seats in the <a href=\"/wiki/United_States_Senate\" title=\"United States Senate\">United States Senate</a><br />51<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>b<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> seats needed for a majority</th></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\" class=\"infobox-full-data\">\n<table style=\"background:transparent; color: inherit; width:100%;\">\n\n\n\n<tbody><tr class=\"sr-only\">\n<th style=\"text-align:left;\">&#160;\n</th>\n<th style=\"text-align:center\">Majority party\n</th>\n<th style=\"text-align:center\">Minority party\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&#160;\n</td>\n<td class=\"notheme\" style=\"text-align:center;border-bottom: 6px solid #0044C9;\"><span class=\"notpageimage noresize\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Chuck_Schumer_official_photo_(3x4a).jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/44/Chuck_Schumer_official_photo_%283x4a%29.jpg/250px-Chuck_Schumer_official_photo_%283x4a%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"135\" height=\"180\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/44/Chuck_Schumer_official_photo_%283x4a%29.jpg/330px-Chuck_Schumer_official_photo_%283x4a%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"1766\" data-file-height=\"2354\" /></a></span>\n</td>\n<td class=\"notheme\" style=\"text-align:center;border-bottom: 6px solid #E81B23;\"><span class=\"notpageimage noresize\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Mitch_McConnell_portrait_2016_(3x4a).jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/38/Mitch_McConnell_portrait_2016_%283x4a%29.jpg/250px-Mitch_McConnell_portrait_2016_%283x4a%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"135\" height=\"180\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/38/Mitch_McConnell_portrait_2016_%283x4a%29.jpg/330px-Mitch_McConnell_portrait_2016_%283x4a%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"1398\" data-file-height=\"1864\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:75px;text-align:left\">Leader\n</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><a href=\"/wiki/Chuck_Schumer\" title=\"Chuck Schumer\">Chuck Schumer</a>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><a href=\"/wiki/Mitch_McConnell\" title=\"Mitch McConnell\">Mitch McConnell</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:75px;text-align:left\">Party\n</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><a href=\"/wiki/Democratic_Party_(United_States)\" title=\"Democratic Party (United States)\">Democratic</a>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><a href=\"/wiki/Republican_Party_(United_States)\" title=\"Republican Party (United States)\">Republican</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:75px;text-align:left\">Leader&#160;since\n</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">January 3, 2017\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">January 3, 2007\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:75px;text-align:left\">Leader's&#160;seat\n</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><a href=\"/wiki/List_of_United_States_senators_from_New_York\" title=\"List of United States senators from New York\">New York</a>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><a href=\"/wiki/List_of_United_States_senators_from_Kentucky\" title=\"List of United States senators from Kentucky\">Kentucky</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:75px;text-align:left\">Seats&#160;before\n</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><b>48 + <a href=\"/wiki/Vice_President_of_the_United_States\" title=\"Vice President of the United States\">VP</a></b><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-majority&#95;3-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-majority-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>c<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-tiebreaker&#95;4-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-tiebreaker-4\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>d<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">50\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:75px;text-align:left\">Seats&#160;after\n</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><b>49</b><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-Sinema&#95;6-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-Sinema-6\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>e<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">49\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:75px;text-align:left\">Seat&#160;change\n</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Increase\"><img alt=\"Increase\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b0/Increase2.svg/20px-Increase2.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"11\" height=\"11\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b0/Increase2.svg/40px-Increase2.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"300\" data-file-height=\"300\" /></span></span> 1\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Decrease\"><img alt=\"Decrease\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/ed/Decrease2.svg/20px-Decrease2.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"11\" height=\"11\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/ed/Decrease2.svg/40px-Decrease2.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"300\" data-file-height=\"300\" /></span></span> 1\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:75px;text-align:left\">Popular&#160;vote\n</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><b>46,208,845</b><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-Runoff&#95;7-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-Runoff-7\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>f<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">43,850,241<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-Runoff&#95;7-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-Runoff-7\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>f<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:75px;text-align:left\">Percentage\n</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><b>50.0%</b>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">47.4%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:75px;text-align:left\">Seats up\n</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">14\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">21\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:75px;text-align:left\">Races won\n</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">15\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">20\n</td></tr>\n\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\"><hr />\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"sr-only\">\n<th style=\"text-align:left;\">&#160;\n</th>\n<th style=\"text-align:center\">Third party\n</th>\n<th style=\"text-align:center\">\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&#160;\n</td>\n<td class=\"notheme\" style=\"text-align:center;border-bottom: 6px solid #DCDCDC;\">\n</td>\n<td class=\"notheme\" style=\"text-align:center;width:0;;\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:75px;text-align:left\">Party\n</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><a href=\"/wiki/Independent_politician\" title=\"Independent politician\">Independent</a>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:75px;text-align:left\">Seats&#160;before\n</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">2<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-majority&#95;3-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-majority-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>c<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:75px;text-align:left\">Seats&#160;after\n</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">2\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:75px;text-align:left\">Seat&#160;change\n</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Steady\"><img alt=\"Steady\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/96/Steady2.svg/20px-Steady2.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"11\" height=\"11\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/96/Steady2.svg/40px-Steady2.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"300\" data-file-height=\"300\" /></span></span>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:75px;text-align:left\">Popular&#160;vote\n</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">686,281\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:75px;text-align:left\