sups\n</td>\n<td style=\"background:#FFFFFF\" class=\"unsortable\">D – 47<br />R – 48<br />5 tossups\n</td>\n<td style=\"background:#FFFFFF\" class=\"unsortable\">D – 44<br />R – 48<br />8 tossups\n</td>\n<td style=\"background:#FFFFFF\" class=\"unsortable\">D – 47<br />R – 49<br />4 tossups\n</td>\n<td style=\"background:#FFFFFF\" class=\"unsortable\">D – 48<br />R – 49<br />3 tossups\n</td>\n<td style=\"background:#FFFFFF\" class=\"unsortable\">D – 48<br />R – 50<br />2 tossups\n</td>\n<td style=\"background:#FFFFFF\" class=\"unsortable\">D – 48<br />R – 50<br />2 tossups\n</td>\n<td style=\"color:black;background-color:#B0CEFF\" class=\"unsortable\"><b>Results</b>:<br />D – 51<br />R – 49\n</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Gains_and_holds\">Gains and holds</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=2022_United_States_Senate_elections&amp;action=edit&amp;section=11\" title=\"Edit section: Gains and holds\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<p>One Democrat and five Republicans retired instead of seeking re-election.\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"Retirements\">Retirements</h3><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=2022_United_States_Senate_elections&amp;action=edit&amp;section=12\" title=\"Edit section: Retirements\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<figure typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:2022_United_States_Senate_elections_retirements_map.svg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/3a/2022_United_States_Senate_elections_retirements_map.svg/250px-2022_United_States_Senate_elections_retirements_map.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\"