o_results_map_by_county.svg/330px-2022_United_States_Senate_election_in_Idaho_results_map_by_county.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"300\" height=\"450\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f9/2022_United_States_Senate_election_in_Idaho_results_map_by_county.svg/960px-2022_United_States_Senate_election_in_Idaho_results_map_by_county.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"540\" data-file-height=\"810\" /></a></span><div>County results<br /><b>Crapo:</b> <span style=\"margin:0px; font-size:90%;\"><span style=\"border:none; background-color:#ffb2b2; color:#ffb2b2;\">&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;</span>&#160;40–50%</span> <span style=\"margin:0px; font-size:90%;\"><span style=\"border:none; background-color:#e27f7f; color:#e27f7f;\">&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;</span>&#160;50–60%</span> <span style=\"margin:0px; font-size:90%;\"><span style=\"border:none; background-color:#d75d5d; color:#d75d5d;\">&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;</span>&#160;60–70%</span> <span style=\"margin:0px; font-size:90%;\"><span style=\"border:none; background-color:#d72f30; color:#d72f30;\">&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;</span>&#160;70–80%</span> <span style=\"margin:0px; font-size:90%;\"><span style=\"border:none; background-color:#C21B18; color:#C21B18;\">&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;</span>&#160;80–90%</span><br /><b>Roth:</b> <span style=\"margin:0px; font-size:90%;\"><span style=\"border:none; background-color:#7996e2; color:#7996e2;\">&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;</span>&#160;50–60%</span> <span style=\"margin:0px; font-size:90%;\"><span style=\"border:none; background-color:#6674DE; color:#6674DE;\">&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;</span>&#160;60–70%</span></div></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\" class=\"infobox-full-data\"><hr />\n<table role=\"presentation\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"background:transparent; color: inherit; width:100%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"width:50%; text-align:left;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/List_of_United_States_senators_from_Idaho\" title=\"List of United States senators from Idaho\">U.S. senator</a> before election</b><br />\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/Mike_Crapo\" title=\"Mike Crapo\">Mike Crapo</a><br />\n<a href=\"/wiki/Republican_Party_(United_States)\" title=\"Republican Party (United States)\">Republican</a>\n</p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:50%; text-align:right;\"><b>Elected U.S. Senator</b> <br />\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/Mike_Crapo\" title=\"Mike Crapo\">Mike Crapo</a><br />\n<a href=\"/wiki/Republican_Party_(United_States)\" title=\"Republican Party (United States)\">Republican</a>\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table>\n<link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1368532237\" /><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote navigation-not-searchable\">Main article: <a href=\"/wiki/2022_United_States_Senate_election_in_Idaho\" title=\"2022 United States Senate election in Idaho\">2022 United States Senate election in Idaho</a></div>\n<link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1368532237\" /><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote navigation-not-searchable\">See also: <a href=\"/wiki/List_of_United_States_senators_from_Idaho\" title=\"List of United States senators from Idaho\">List of United States senators from Idaho</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/2022_United_States_House_of_Representatives_elections_in_Idaho\" title=\"2022 United States House of Representatives elections in Idaho\">2022 United States House of Representatives elections in Idaho</a></div>\n<p>Four-term Republican <a href=\"/wiki/Mike_Crapo\" title=\"Mike Crapo\">Mike Crapo</a> was <a href=\"/wiki/2016_United_States_Senate_election_in_Idaho\" title=\"2016 United States Senate election in Idaho\">re-elected in 2016</a> with 66.1% of the vote. He ran for re-election to a fifth term.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-143\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-143\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>118<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> Democrat David Roth faced Crapo in the general election after defeating Ben Pursley in the primary.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-144\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-144\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>119<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\";\">\n<caption>Idaho Republican primary<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-IDprimary&#95;145-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-IDprimary-145\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>120<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</caption>\n<tbody><tr>\n<th scope=\"col\" colspan=\"2\" style=\"width: 15em\">Party\n</th>\n<th scope=\"col\" style=\"width: 17em\">Candidate\n</th>\n<th scope=\"col\" style=\"width: 5em\">Votes\n</th>\n<th scope=\"col\" style=\"width: 3.5em\">%\n</th></tr>\n\n\n<tr class=\"vcard\">\n<td style=\"color:inherit;background-color:#E81B23;width:5px\">\n</td>\n<td class=\"org\" style=\"width:130px\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/Republican_Party_(United_States)\" title=\"Republican Party (United States)\">Republican</a></b>\n</td>\n<th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-align:left; font-weight:normal; color:inherit; background:inherit;\" class=\"fn\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/Mike_Crapo\" title=\"Mike Crapo\">Mike Crapo</a> (incumbent) </b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:right;margin-right:0.5em\"><b>177,906 </b>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right;margin-right:0.5em\"><b>67.13 </b>\n</td></tr>\n\n\n<tr class=\"vcard\">\n<td style=\"color:inherit;background-color:#E81B23;width:2px\">\n</td>\n<td class=\"org\" style=\"width:130px\"><a href=\"/wiki/Republican_Party_(United_States)\" title=\"Republican Party (United States)\">Republican</a>\n</td>\n<th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-align: left; font-weight:normal; color:inherit; background:inherit;\" class=\"fn\">Scott Trotter\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">27,699\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">10.45\n</td></tr>\n\n\n<tr class=\"vcard\">\n<td style=\"color:inherit;background-color:#E81B23;width:2px\">\n</td>\n<td class=\"org\" style=\"width:130px\"><a href=\"/wiki/Republican_Party_(United_States)\" title=\"Republican Party (United States)\">Republican</a>\n</td>\n<th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-align: left; font-weight:normal; color:inherit; background:inherit;\" class=\"fn\">Brenda Bourn\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">21,612\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">8.16\n</td></tr>\n\n\n<tr class=\"vcard\">\n<td style=\"color:inherit;background-color:#E81B23;width:2px\">\n</td>\n<td class=\"org\" style=\"width:130px\"><a href=\"/wiki/Republican_Party_(United_States)\" title=\"Republican Party (United States)\">Republican</a>\n</td>\n<th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-align: left; font-weight:normal; color:inherit; background:inherit;\" class=\"fn\">Ramont Turnbull\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">20,883\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">7.88\n</td></tr>\n\n\n<tr class=\"vcard\">\n<td style=\"color:inherit;background-color:#E81B23;width:2px\">\n</td>\n<td class=\"org\" style=\"width:130px\"><a href=\"/wiki/Republican_Party_(United_States)\" title=\"Republican Party (United States)\">Republican</a>\n</td>\n<th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-align: left; font-weight:normal; color:inherit; background:inherit;\" class=\"fn\">Natalie Fleming\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">16,902\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">6.38\n</td></tr>\n\n\n<tr>\n<th scope=\"row\" colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:right;\">Total votes\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:right;\"><b>265,002 </b>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right;\"><b>100.00 </b>\n</td></tr>\n\n</tbody></table>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\";\">\n<caption>Idaho Democratic primary<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-IDprimary&#95;145-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-IDprimary-145\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>120<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></