pedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"109\" height=\"136\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/3d/Charles_solar_panels_%28cropped%29.jpg/250px-Charles_solar_panels_%28cropped%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"1492\" data-file-height=\"1865\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:75px;text-align:left\">Nominee\n</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/Rand_Paul\" title=\"Rand Paul\">Rand Paul</a></b>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><a href=\"/wiki/Charles_Booker_(American_politician)\" title=\"Charles Booker (American politician)\">Charles Booker</a>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:75px;text-align:left\">Party\n</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><a href=\"/wiki/Republican_Party_(US)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Republican Party (US)\">Republican</a>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><a href=\"/wiki/Democratic_Party_(US)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Democratic Party (US)\">Democratic</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:75px;text-align:left\">Popular&#160;vote\n</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><b>913,326</b>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">564,311\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:75px;text-align:left\">Percentage\n</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><b>61.8%</b>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">38.2%\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n</tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\" class=\"infobox-full-data\"><hr /><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:2022_United_States_Senate_election_in_Kentucky_results_map_by_county.svg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/8a/2022_United_States_Senate_election_in_Kentucky_results_map_by_county.svg/330px-2022_United_States_Senate_election_in_Kentucky_results_map_by_county.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"300\" height=\"132\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/8a/2022_United_States_Senate_election_in_Kentucky_results_map_by_county.svg/960px-2022_United_States_Senate_election_in_Kentucky_results_map_by_county.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"810\" data-file-height=\"357\" /></a></span><div>County results<br /><b>Paul:</b> <span style=\"margin:0px; font-size:90%;\"><span style=\"border:none; background-color:#e27f7f; color:#e27f7f;\">&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;</span>&#160;50–60%</span> <span style=\"margin:0px; font-size:90%;\"><span style=\"border:none; background-color:#d75d5d; color:#d75d5d;\">&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;</span>&#160;60–70%</span> <span style=\"margin:0px; font-size:90%;\"><span style=\"border:none; background-color:#d72f30; color:#d72f30;\">&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;</span>&#160;70–80%</span> <span style=\"margin:0px; font-size:90%;\"><span style=\"border:none; background-color:#c21b18; color:#c21b18;\">&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;</span>&#160;80–90%</span><br /><b>Booker:</b> <span style=\"margin:0px; font-size:90%;\"><span style=\"border:none; background-color:#7996e2; color:#7996e2;\">&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;</span>&#160;50–60%</span> <span style=\"margin:0px; font-size:90%;\"><span style=\"border:none; background-color:#6674DE; color:#6674DE;\">&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;</span>&#160;60–70%</span></div></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\" class=\"infobox-full-data\"><hr />\n<table role=\"presentation\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"background:transparent; color: inherit; width:100%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"width:50%; text-align:left;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/List_of_United_States_senators_from_Kentucky\" title=\"List of United States senators from Kentucky\">U.S. senator</a> before election</b><br />\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/Rand_Paul\" title=\"Rand Paul\">Rand Paul</a><br />\n<a href=\"/wiki/Republican_Party_(US)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Republican Party (US)\">Republican</a>\n</p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:50%; text-align:right;\"><b>Elected U.S. Senator</b> <br />\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/Rand_Paul\" title=\"Rand Paul\">Rand Paul</a><br />\n<a href=\"/wiki/Republican_Party_(US)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Republican Party (US)\">Republican</a>\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table>\n<link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1368532237\" /><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote navigation-not-searchable\">Main article: <a href=\"/wiki/2022_United_States_Senate_election_in_Kentucky\" title=\"2022 United States Senate election in Kentucky\">2022 United States Senate election in Kentucky</a></div>\n<link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1368532237\" /><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote navigation-not-searchable\">See also: <a href=\"/wiki/List_of_United_States_senators_from_Kentucky\" title=\"List of United States senators from Kentucky\">List of United States senators from Kentucky</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/2022_United_States_House_of_Representatives_elections_in_Kentucky\" title=\"2022 United States House of Representatives elections in Kentucky\">2022 United States House of Representatives elections in Kentucky</a></div>\n<p>Two-term Republican <a href=\"/wiki/Rand_Paul\" title=\"Rand Paul\">Rand Paul</a> was <a href=\"/wiki/2016_United_States_Senate_election_in_Kentucky\" title=\"2016 United States Senate election in Kentucky\">re-elected in 2016</a> with 57.3% of the vote. He sought re-election to a third term.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-auto3&#95;164-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-auto3-164\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>139<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</p><p>Former Democratic <a href=\"/wiki/Kentucky_House_of_Representatives\" title=\"Kentucky House of Representatives\">state representative</a> and 2020 runner-up in the Democratic U.S. Senate primary <a href=\"/wiki/Charles_Booker_(American_politician)\" title=\"Charles Booker (American politician)\">Charles Booker</a> won the Democratic primary.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-165\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-165\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>140<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\";\">\n<caption>Kentucky Republican primary<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-KYprimary&#95;166-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-KYprimary-166\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>141<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</caption>\n<tbody><tr>\n<th scope=\"col\" colspan=\"2\" style=\"width: 15em\">Party\n</th>\n<th scope=\"col\" style=\"width: 17em\">Candidate\n</th>\n<th scope=\"col\" style=\"width: 5em\">Votes\n</th>\n<th scope=\"col\" style=\"width: 3.5em\">%\n</th></tr>\n\n\n<tr class=\"vcard\">\n<td style=\"color:inherit;background-color:#E81B23;width:5px\">\n</td>\n<td class=\"org\" style=\"width:130px\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/Republican_Party_(United_States)\" title=\"Republican Party (United States)\">Republican</a></b>\n</td>\n<th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-align:left; font-weight:normal; color:inherit; background:inherit;\" class=\"fn\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/Rand_Paul\" title=\"Rand Paul\">Rand Paul</a> (incumbent) </b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:right;margin-right:0.5em\"><b>333,051 </b>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right;margin-right:0.5em\"><b>86.35 </b>\n</td></tr>\n\n\n<tr class=\"vcard\">\n<td style=\"color:inherit;background-color:#E81B23;width:2px\">\n</td>\n<td class=\"org\" style=\"width:130px\"><a href=\"/wiki/Republican_Party_(United_States)\" title=\"Republican Party (United States)\">Republican</a>\n</td>\n<th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-align: left; font-weight:normal; color:inherit; background:inherit;\" class=\"fn\">Valerie Frederick\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">14,018\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">3.63\n</td></tr>\n\n\n<tr class=\"vcard\">\n<td style=\"color:inherit;background-color:#E81B23;width:2px\">\n</td>\n<td class=\"org\" style=\"width:130px\"><a href=\"/wiki/Republican_Party_(United_States)\" title=\"Republican Party (United States)\">Republican</a>\n</td>\n<th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-align: left; font-weight:normal; color:inherit; background:inherit;\" class=\"fn\">Paul V. Hamilton\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">13,473\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">3.49\n</td></tr>\n\n\n<tr class=\"vcard\">\n<td style=\"color:inherit;background-color:#E81B23;width:2px\">\n</td>\n<td class=\"org\" style=\"width:130px\"><a href=\"/wiki/Republican_Party_(United_States)\" title=\"Republican Party (United States)\">Republican</a>\n</td>\n<th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-align: left; font-weight:normal; color:inherit; background:inherit;\" class=\"fn\">Arnold Blankenship\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">10,092\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">2.62\n</td></tr>\n\n\n<tr class=\"vcard\">\n<td style=\"color:inherit;background-color:#E81B23;width:2px\">\n</td>\n<td class=\"org\" style=\"width:130px\"><a href=\"/wiki/Republican_Party_(United_States)\" title=\"Republican Party (United States)\">Republican</a>\n</td>\n<th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-align: left; font-weight:normal; color:inherit; background:inherit;\" class=\"fn\">Tami Stanfield\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">9,526\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">2.47\n</td></tr>\n\n\n<tr class=\"vcard\">\n<td style=\"color:inherit;background-color:#E81B23;width:2px\">\n</td>\n<td class=\"org\" style=\"width:130px\"><a href=\"/wiki/Republican_Party_(United_States)\" title=\"Republican Party (United States)\">Republican</a>\n</td>\n<th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-align: left; font-weight:normal; color:inherit; backgrou