ion\">±%</span>\n</th></tr>\n\n\n<tr class=\"vcard\">\n<td style=\"color:inherit;background-color:#E81B23; width:5px;\">\n</td>\n<td class=\"org\" style=\"width:130px\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/Republican_Party_(United_States)\" title=\"Republican Party (United States)\">Republican</a></b>\n</td>\n<th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-align:left; font-weight:normal; color:inherit; background:inherit;\" class=\"fn\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/Rand_Paul\" title=\"Rand Paul\">Rand Paul</a> (incumbent) </b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:right; margin-right:0.5em\"><b>913,326 </b>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right; margin-right:0.5em\"><b>61.80% </b>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right; margin-right:0.5em\"><b>+4.53 </b>\n</td></tr>\n\n\n<tr class=\"vcard\">\n<td style=\"color:inherit; background-color: #0044C9; width: 5px;\">\n</td>\n<td class=\"org\" style=\"width: 130px\"><a href=\"/wiki/Democratic_Party_(United_States)\" title=\"Democratic Party (United States)\">Democratic</a>\n</td>\n<th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-align:left; font-weight:normal; color:inherit; background:inherit;\" class=\"fn\"><a href=\"/wiki/Charles_Booker_(American_politician)\" title=\"Charles Booker (American politician)\">Charles Booker</a>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align: right; margin-right: 0.5em\">564,311\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: right; margin-right: 0.5em\">38.19%\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: right; margin-right: 0.5em\">−4.54\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n<tr class=\"vcard\">\n<td style=\"color:inherit;background-color: white; width: 2px;\">\n</td>\n<td class=\"org\" colspan=\"2\"><a href=\"/wiki/Write-in_candidate\" title=\"Write-in candidate\">Write-in</a>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right;\">193\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right;\">0.01%\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right;\">+0.01\n</td></tr>\n\n<tr>\n<th scope=\"col\" colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:right;\">Total votes\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:right;\"><b>1,477,830 </b>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right;\"><b>100.0% </b>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right;\">\n</td></tr>\n\n\n<tr>\n<td style=\"color:inherit;background-color: #E81B23;\">\n</td>\n<th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-align:left; font-weight:normal; color:inherit; background:inherit;\" colspan=\"5\"><a href=\"/wiki/Republican_Party_(United_States)\" title=\"Republican Party (United States)\">Republican</a> <b>hold</b>\n</th></tr>\n\n\n</tbody></table>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\" class=\"\"></div>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Louisiana\">Louisiana</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=2022_United_States_Senate_elections&amp;action=edit&amp;section=34\" title=\"Edit section: Louisiana\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1358620234\" /><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1315121714\" /><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1152813436\" /><table class=\"infobox ib-election infobox-table\" style=\"width:300px\"><caption class=\"infobox-title summary\">Louisiana election</caption><tbody><tr><td colspan=\"2\" class=\"infobox-subheader\"><span class=\"flagicon\"><span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e0/Flag_of_Louisiana.svg/60px-Flag_of_Louisiana.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"32\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e0/Flag_of_Louisiana.svg/120px-Flag_of_Louisiana.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"7040\" data-file-height=\"4556\" /></span></span></span><hr /></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\" class=\"infobox-subheader\"><div style=\"width:100%\"><div style=\"float: left; text-align:left;padding-right:0.5em;width:20%;\" class=\"noprint\">&#8592;&#160;<a href=\"/wiki/2016_United_States_Senate_election_in_Louisiana\" title=\"2016 United States Senate election in Louisiana\">2016</a></div><div style=\"float: right; text-align:right;padding-left:0.5em;width:20%;\" class=\"noprint\"><a href=\"/wiki/2028_United_States_Senate_election_in_Louisiana\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2028 United States Senate election in Louisiana\">2028</a>&#160;&#8594;</div></div></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\" class=\"infobox-full-data\">\n<table style=\"background:transparent; color: inherit; width:100%;\">\n\n\n\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>&#160;\n</td>\n<td class=\"notheme\" style=\"text-align:center;border-bottom: 6px solid #E81B23;\"><span class=\"notpageimage noresize\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:John_Neely_Kennedy,_official_portrait,_115th_Congress.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/2f/John_Neely_Kennedy%2C_official_portrait%2C_115th_Congress.jpg/120px-John_Neely_Kennedy%2C_official_portrait%2C_115th_Congress.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"107\" height=\"136\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/2f/John_Neely_Kennedy%2C_official_portrait%2C_115th_Congress.jpg/250px-John_Neely_Kennedy%2C_official_portrait%2C_115th_Congress.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"593\" data-file-height=\"752\" /></a></span>\n</td>\n<td class=\"notheme\" style=\"text-align:center;border-bottom: 6px solid #0044C9;\"><span class=\"notpageimage noresize\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Gary_Chambers_Jr_mirror.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/bb/Gary_Chambers_Jr_mirror.png/120px-Gary_Chambers_Jr_mirror.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"105\" height=\"136\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/bb/Gary_Chambers_Jr_mirror.png/250px-Gary_Chambers_Jr_mirror.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"501\" data-file-height=\"649\" /></a></span>\n</td>\n<td class=\"notheme\" style=\"text-align:center;border-bottom: 6px solid #0044C9;\"><span class=\"notpageimage noresize\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:3x4.svg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/bd/3x4.svg/120px-3x4.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"102\" height=\"136\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/bd/3x4.svg/250px-3x4.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"3\" data-file-height=\"4\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:75px;text-align:left\">Candidate\n</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/John_Kennedy_(Louisiana_politician)\" title=\"John Kennedy (Louisiana politician)\">John Kennedy</a></b>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><a href=\"/wiki/Gary_Chambers\" title=\"Gary Chambers\">Gary Chambers</a>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">Luke Mixon\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:75px;text-align:left\">Party\n</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><a href=\"/wiki/Republican_Party_(United_States)\" title=\"Republican Party (United States)\">Republican</a>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><a href=\"/wiki/Democratic_Party_(United_States)\" title=\"Democratic Party (United States)\">Democratic</a>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><a href=\"/wiki/Democratic_Party_(United_States)\" title=\"Democratic Party (United States)\">Democratic</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:75px;text-align:left\">Popular&#160;vote\n</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><b>851,568</b>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">246,933\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">182,877\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:75px;text-align:left\">Percentage\n</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><b>61.6%</b>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">17.9%\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">13.2%\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n</tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\" class=\"infobox-full-data\"><hr /><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:2022_United_States_Senate_election_in_Louisiana_results_map_by_parish.svg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a2/2022_United_States_Senate_election_in_Louisiana_results_map_by_parish.svg/330px-2022_United_States_Senate_election_in_Louisiana_results_map_by_parish.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"300\" height=\"274\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a2/2022_United_States_Senate_election_in_Louisiana_results_map_by_parish.svg/960px-2022_United_States_Senate_election_in_Louisiana_results_map_by_parish.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"810\" data-file-height=\"739\" /></a></span><div>Parish results<br /><b>Kennedy:</b> <span style=\"margin:0px; font-size:90%;\"><span style=\"border:none; background-color:#ffc8cd; color:#ffc8cd;\">&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;</span>&#160;30–40%</span> <span style=\"margin:0px; font-size:90%;\"><span style=\"border:none; background-color:#ffb2b2; color:#ffb2b2;\">&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;</span>&#160;40–50%</span> <span style=\"margin:0px; font-size:90%;\"><span style=\"border:none; background-color:#e27f7f; color:#e27f7f;\">&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;</span>&#160;50–60%</span> <span style=\"margin:0px; font-size:90%;\"><span style=\"border:none; background-color:#d75d5d; color:#d75d5d;\">&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;</span>&#160;60–70%</span> <span style=\"margin:0px; font-size:90%;\"><span style=\"border:none; background-color:#d72f30; color:#d72f30;\">&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;</span>&#160;70–80%</span> <span style=\"margin:0px; font-size:90%;\"><span style=\"border:none; background-color:#c21b18; color:#c21b18;\">&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;</span>&#160;80–90%</span> <span style=\"margin:0px; font-size:90%;\"><span style=\"border:none; background-color:#a80000; color:#a80000;\">&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;</span>&#160;90–100%</span><br /><b>Chambers</b>:  <span style=\"margin:0px; font-size:90%;\"><span style=\"border:none; background-color:#a5b0ff; color:#a5b0ff;\">&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;</span>&#160;40–50%</span></div></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\" class=\"infobox-full-data\"><hr />\n<table role=\"presentation\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"background:transparent; color: inherit; width:100%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"width:50%; text-align:left;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/List_of_United_States_senators_from_Louisiana\" title=\"List of United States senators from Louisiana\">U.S. senator</a> before election</b><br />\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/John_Kennedy_(Louisiana_politician)\" title=\"John Kennedy (Louisiana politician)\">John Kennedy</a><br />\n<a href=\"/wiki/Republican_Party_(United_States)\" title=\"Republican Party (United States)\">Republican</a>\n</p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:50%; text-align:right;\"><b>Elected U.S. Senator</b> <br />\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/John_Kennedy_(Louisiana_politician)\" title=\"John Kennedy (Louisiana politician)\">John Kennedy</a><br />\n<a href=\"/wiki/Republican_Party_(United_States)\" title=\"Republican Party (United States)\">Republican</a>\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1368532237\" /><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote navigation-not-searchable\">Main article: <a href=\"/wiki/2022_United_States_Senate_election_in_Louisiana\" title=\"2022 United States Senate election in Louisiana\">2022 United States Senate election in Louisiana</a></div>\n<link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1368532237\" /><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote navigation-not-searchable\">See also: <a href=\"/wiki/List_of_United_States_senators_from_Louisiana\" title=\"List of United States senators from Louisiana\">List of United States senators from Louisiana</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/2022_United_States_House_of_Representatives_elections_in_Louisiana\" title=\"2022 United States House of Representatives elections in Louisiana\">2022 United States House of Representatives elections in Louisiana</a></div>\n<p>One-term Republican <a href=\"/wiki/John_Kennedy_(Louisiana_politician)\" title=\"John Kennedy (Louisiana politician)\">John Kennedy</a> was <a href=\"/wiki/2016_United_States_Senate_election_in_Louisiana\" title=\"2016 United States Senate election in Louisiana\">elected in 2016</a> with 60.6% of the vote and ran for a second term.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-:1&#95;168-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-:1-168\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>143<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> Civil rights activist <a href=\"/wiki/Gary_Chambers\" title=\"Gary Chambers\">Gary Chambers</a> and U.S. Navy veteran Luke Mixon ran as Democrats.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-169\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-169\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>144<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-170\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-170\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>145<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\";\">\n<caption>Louisiana general election<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-171\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-171\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>146<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</caption>\n<tbody><tr>\n<th scope=\"col\" colspan=\"2\" style=\"width: 15em\">Party\n</th>\n<th scope=\"col\" style=\"width: 17em\">Candidate\n</th>\n<th scope=\"col\" style=\"width: 5em\">Votes\n</th>\n<th scope=\"col\" style=\"width: 3.5em\">%\n</th></tr>\n\n\n<tr class=\"vcard\">\n<td style=\"color:inherit;background-color:#E81B23;width:5px\">\n</td>\n<td class=\"org\" style=\"width:130px\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/Republican_Party_(United_States)\" title=\"Republican Party (United States)\">Republican</a></b>\n</td>\n<th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-align:left; font-weight:normal; color:inherit; background:inherit;\" class=\"fn\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/John_Kennedy_(Louisiana_politician)\" title=\"John Kennedy (Louisiana politician)\">John Kennedy</a> (incumbent) </b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:right;margin-right:0.5em\"><b>851,568 </b>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right;margin-right:0.5em\"><b>61.56 </b>\n</td></tr>\n\n\n<tr class=\"vcard\">\n<td style=\"color:inherit;background-color:#0044C9;width:2px\">\n</td>\n<td class=\"org\" style=\"width:130px\"><a href=\"/wiki/Democratic_Party_(United_States)\" title=\"Democratic Party (United States)\">Democratic</a>\n</td>\n<th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-align: left; font-weight:normal; color:inherit; background:inherit;\" class=\"fn\"><a href=\"/wiki/Gary_Chambers\" title=\"Gary Chambers\">Gary Chambers</a>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">246,933\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">17.85\n</td></tr>\n\n\n<tr class=\"vcard\">\n<td style=\"color:inherit;background-color:#0044C9;width:2px\">\n</td>\n<td class=\"org\" style=\"width:130px\"><a href=\"/wiki/Democratic_Party_(United_States)\" title=\"Democratic Party (United States)\">Democratic</a>\n</td>\n<th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-align: left; font-weight:normal; color:inherit; background:inherit;\" class=\"fn\">Luke Mixon\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">182,887\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">13.22\n</td></tr>\n\n\n<tr class=\"vcard\">\n<td style=\"color:inherit;background-color:#0044C9;width:2px\">\n</td>\n<td class=\"org\" style=\"width:130px\"><a href=\"/wiki/Democratic_Party_(United_States)\" title=\"Democratic Party (United States)\">Democratic</a>\n</td>\n<th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-align: left; font-weight:normal; color:inherit; background:inherit;\" class=\"fn\">Syrita Steib\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">31,568\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">2.28\n</td></tr>\n\n\n<tr class=\"vcard\">\n<td style=\"color:inherit;background-color:#E81B23;width:2px\">\n</td>\n<td class=\"org\" style=\"width:130px\"><a href=\"/wiki/Republican_Party_(United_States)\" title=\"Republican Party (United States)\">Republican</a>\n</td>\n<th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-align: left; font-weight:normal; color:inherit; background:inherit;\" class=\"fn\">Devin Lance Graham\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">25,275\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">1.83\n</td></tr>\n\n\n<tr class=\"vcard\">\n<td style=\"color:inherit;background-color:#0044C9;width:2px\">\n</td>\n<td class=\"org\" style=\"width:130px\"><a href=\"/wiki/Democratic_Party_(United_States)\" title=\"Democratic Party (United States)\">Democratic</a>\n</td>\n<th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-align: left; font-weight:normal; color:inherit; background:inherit;\" class=\"fn\">Vinny Mendoza\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">11,910\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">0.86\n</td></tr>\n\n\n<tr class=\"vcard\">\n<td style=\"color:inherit;background-color:#DCDCDC;width:2px\">\n</td>\n<td class=\"org\" style=\"width:130px\"><a href=\"/wiki/Independent_politician\" title=\"Independent politician\">Independent</a>\n</td>\n<th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-align: left; font-weight:normal; color:inherit; background:inherit;\" class=\"fn\">Beryl Billiot\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">9,378\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">0.68\n</td></tr>\n\n\n<tr class=\"vcard\">\n<td style=\"color:inherit;background-color:#0044C9;width:2px\">\n</td>\n<td class=\"org\" style=\"width:130px\"><a href=\"/wiki/Democratic_Party_(United_States)\" title=\"Democratic Party (United States)\">Democratic</a>\n</td>\n<th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-align: left; font-weight:normal; color:inherit; background:inherit;\" class=\"fn\">Salvador P. Rodriguez\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">7,767\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">0.56\n</td></tr>\n\n\n<tr class=\"vcard\">\n<td style=\"color:inherit;background-color:#DCDCDC;width:2px\">\n</td>\n<td class=\"org\" style=\"width:130px\"><a href=\"/wiki/Independent_politician\" title=\"Independent politician\">Independent</a>\n</td>\n<th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-align: left; font-weight:normal; color:inherit; background:inherit;\" class=\"fn\">Bradley McMorris\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">5,388\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">0.39\n</td></tr>\n\n\n<tr class=\"vcard\">\n<td style=\"color:inherit;background-color:#fed000;width:2px\">\n</td>\n<td class=\"org\" style=\"width:130px\"><a href=\"/wiki/Libertarian_Party_(United_States)\" title=\"Libertarian Party (United States)\">Libertarian</a>\n</td>\n<th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-align: left; font-weight:normal; color:inherit; background:inherit;\" class=\"fn\">Aaron C. Sigler\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">4,865\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">0.35\n</td></tr>\n\n\n<tr class=\"vcard\">\n<td style=\"color:inherit;background-color:#DCDCDC;width:2px\">\n</td>\n<td class=\"org\" style=\"width:130px\"><a href=\"/wiki/Independent_politician\" title=\"Independent politician\">Independent</a>\n</td>\n<th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-align: left; font-weight:normal; color:inherit; background:inherit;\" class=\"fn\">Xan John\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">2,753\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">0.20\n</td></tr>\n\n\n<tr class=\"vcard\">\n<td style=\"color:inherit;background-color:#DCDCDC;width:2px\">\n</td>\n<td class=\"org\" style=\"width:130px\"><a href=\"/wiki/Independent_politician\" title=\"Independent politician\">Independent</a>\n</td>\n<th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-align: left; font-weight:normal; color:inherit; background:inherit;\" class=\"fn\">W. Thomas La Fontaine Olson\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">1,676\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">0.12\n</td></tr>\n\n\n<tr class=\"vcard\">\n<td style=\"color:inherit;background-color:#DCDCDC;width:2px\">\n</td>\n<td class=\"org\" style=\"width:130px\"><a href=\"/wiki/Independent_politician\" title=\"Independent politician\">Independent</a>\n</td>\n<th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-align: left; font-weight:normal; color:inherit; background:inherit;\" class=\"fn\">Thomas Wenn\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">1,322\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">0.10\n</td></tr>\n\n\n<tr>\n<th scope=\"row\" colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:right;\">Total votes\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:right;\"><b>1,383,290 </b>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right;\"><b>100.00 </b>\n</td></tr>\n\n\n<tr>\n<td style=\"color:inherit;background-color: #E81B23;\">\n</td>\n<th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-align:left; font-weight:normal; color:inherit; background:inherit;\" colspan=\"5\"><a href=\"/wiki/Republican_Party_(United_States)\" title=\"Republican Party (United States)\">Republican</a> <b>hold</b>\n</th></tr>\n\n\n</tbody></table>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\" class=\"\"></div>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Maryland\">Maryland</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=2022_United_States_Senate_elections&amp;action=edit&amp;section=35\" title=\"Edit section: Maryland\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1368532237\" /><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote navigation-not-searchable\">Main article: <a href=\"/wiki/2022_United_States_Senate_election_in_Maryland\" title=\"2022 United States Senate election in Maryland\">2022 United States Senate election in Maryland</a></div>\n<link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1368532237\" /><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote navigation-not-searchable\">See also: <a href=\"/wiki/List_of_United_States_senators_from_Maryland\" title=\"List of United States senators from Maryland\">List of United States senators from Maryland</a></div>\n<link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1358620234\" /><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1315121714\" /><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1152813436\" /><table class=\"infobox ib-election infobox-table\" style=\"width:300px\"><caption class=\"infobox-title summary\">Maryland election</caption><tbody><tr><td colspan=\"2\" class=\"infobox-subheader\"><span class=\"flagicon\"><span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a0/Flag_of_Maryland.svg/60px-Flag_of_Maryland.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"33\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a0/Flag_of_Maryland.svg/120px-Flag_of_Maryland.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"750\" data-file-height=\"500\" /></span></span></span><hr /></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\" class=\"infobox-subheader\"><div style=\"width:100%\"><div style=\"float: left; text-align:left;padding-right:0.5em;width:20%;\" class=\"noprint\">&#8592;&#160;<a href=\"/wiki/2016_United_States_Senate_election_in_Maryland\" title=\"2016 United States Senate election in Maryland\">2016</a></div><div style=\"float: right; text-align:right;padding-left:0.5em;width:20%;\" class=\"noprint\"><a href=\"/wiki/2028_United_States_Senate_election_in_Maryland\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2028 United States Senate election in Maryland\">2028</a>&#160;&#8594;</div></div></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\" class=\"infobox-full-data\">\n<table style=\"background:transparent; color: inherit; width:100%;\">\n\n\n\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>&#160;\n</td>\n<td class=\"notheme\" style=\"text-align:center;border-bottom: 6px solid #0044C9;\"><span class=\"notpageimage noresize\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Chris_Van_Hollen_official_portrait_115th_Congress_(cropped).jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/37/Chris_Van_Hollen_official_portrait_115th_Congress_%28cropped%29.jpg/120px-Chris_Van_Hollen_official_portrait_115th_Congress_%28cropped%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"102\" height=\"136\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/37/Chris_Van_Hollen_official_portrait_115th_Congress_%28cropped%29.jpg/250px-Chris_Van_Hollen_official_portrait_115th_Congress_%28cropped%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"605\" data-file-height=\"804\" /></a></span>\n</td>\n<td class=\"notheme\" style=\"text-align:center;border-bottom: 6px solid #E81B23;\"><span class=\"notpageimage noresize\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Chris_Chaffee.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/5c/Chris_Chaffee.jpg/120px-Chris_Chaffee.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"102\" height=\"136\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/5c/Chris_Chaffee.jpg/250px-Chris_Chaffee.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"1024\" data-file-height=\"1365\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:75px;text-align:left\">Nominee\n</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/Chris_Van_Hollen\" title=\"Chris Van Hollen\">Chris Van Hollen</a></b>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">Chris Chaffee\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:75px;text-align:left\">Party\n</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><a href=\"/wiki/Democratic_Party_(United_States)\" title=\"Democratic Party (United States)\">Democratic</a>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><a href=\"/wiki/Republican_Party_(United_States)\" title=\"Republican Party (United States)\">Republican</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:75px;text-align:left\">Popular&#160;vote\n</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><b>1,316,897</b>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">682,293\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:75px;text-align:left\">Percentage\n</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><b>65.8%</b>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">34.1%\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n</tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\" class=\"infobox-full-data\"><hr /><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:2022_United_States_Senate_election_in_Maryland_results_map_by_county.svg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/be/2022_United_States_Senate_election_in_Maryland_results_map_by_county.svg/330px-2022_United_States_Senate_election_in_Maryland_results_map_by_county.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"300\" height=\"160\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/be/2022_United_States_Senate_election_in_Maryland_results_map_by_county.svg/960px-2022_United_States_Senate_election_in_Maryland_results_map_by_county.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"810\" data-file-height=\"433\" /></a></span><div>County results <br /><b>Van Hollen:</b> <span style=\"margin:0px; font-size:90%;\"><span style=\"border:none; background-color:#6674DE; color:#6674DE;\">&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;</span>&#160;60–70%</span> <span style=\"margin:0px; font-size:90%;\"><span style=\"border:none; background-color:#584CDE; color:#584CDE;\">&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;</span>&#160;70–80%</span> <span style=\"margin:0px; font-size:90%;\"><span style=\"border:none; background-color:#3933E5; color:#3933E5;\">&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;</span>&#160;80–90%</span> <span style=\"margin:0px; font-size:90%;\"><span style=\"border:none; background-color:#0D0596; color:#0D0596;\">&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;</span>&#160;&gt;90%</span><br /><b>Chaffee:</b> <span style=\"margin:0px; font-size:90%;\"><span style=\"border:none; background-color:#E27F7F; color:#E27F7F;\">&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;</span>&#160;50–60%</span> <span style=\"margin:0px; font-size:90%;\"><span style=\"border:none; background-color:#D75D5D; color:#D75D5D;\">&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;</span>&#160;60–70%</span> <span style=\"margin:0px; font-size:90%;\"><span style=\"border:none; background-color:#D72F30; color:#D72F30;\">&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;</span>&#160;70–80%</span></div></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\" class=\"infobox-full-data\"><hr />\n<table role=\"presentation\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"background:transparent; color: inherit; width:100%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"width:50%; text-align:left;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/List_of_United_States_senators_from_Maryland\" title=\"List of United States senators from Maryland\">U.S. senator</a> before election</b><br />\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/Chris_Van_Hollen\" title=\"Chris Van Hollen\">Chris Van Hollen</a><br />\n<a href=\"/wiki/Democratic_Party_(United_States)\" title=\"Democratic Party (United States)\">Democratic</a>\n</p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:50%; text-align:right;\"><b>Elected U.S. senator</b> <br />\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/Chris_Van_Hollen\" title=\"Chris Van Hollen\">Chris Van Hollen</a><br />\n<a href=\"/wiki/Democratic_Party_(United_States)\" title=\"Democratic Party (United States)\">Democratic</a>\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p>One-term Democrat <a href=\"/wiki/Chris_Van_Hollen\" title=\"Chris Van Hollen\">Chris Van Hollen</a> was <a href=\"/wiki/2016_United_States_Senate_election_in_Maryland\" title=\"2016 United States Senate election in Maryland\">elected in 2016</a> with 60.9% of the vote, and ran for a second term.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-VanHollenRunning&#95;172-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-VanHollenRunning-172\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>147<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</p><p>Despite previously indicating that he had no interest in pursuing the Republican nomination for the U.S. Senate, incumbent <a href=\"/wiki/Governor_of_Maryland\" title=\"Governor of Maryland\">governor</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Larry_Hogan\" title=\"Larry Hogan\">Larry Hogan</a>, who was term-limited and scheduled to leave office in 2023, told conservative talk radio host <a href=\"/wiki/Hugh_Hewitt\" title=\"Hugh Hewitt\">Hugh Hewitt</a> in October 2021 that he was considering challenging Van Hollen. Hogan ultimately decided not to challenge Van Hollen on February 8, 2022.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-173\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-173\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>148<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-174\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-174\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>149<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-175\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-175\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>150<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</p><p>Van Hollen and construction company owner Chris Chaffee won their respective primaries on July 19.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-176\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-176\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>151<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\";\">\n<caption>Maryland Democratic primary<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-MDprimary&#95;177-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-MDprimary-177\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>152<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</caption>\n<tbody><tr>\n<th scope=\"col\" colspan=\"2\" style=\"width: 15em\">Party\n</th>\n<th scope=\"col\" style=\"width: 17em\">Candidate\n</th>\n<th scope=\"col\" style=\"width: 5em\">Votes\n</th>\n<th scope=\"col\" style=\"width: 3.5em\">%\n</th></tr>\n\n\n<tr class=\"vcard\">\n<td style=\"color:inherit;background-color:#0044C9;width:5px\">\n</td>\n<td class=\"org\" style=\"width:130px\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/Democratic_Party_(United_States)\" title=\"Democratic Party (United States)\">Democratic</a></b>\n</td>\n<th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-align:left; font-weight:normal; color:inherit; background:inherit;\" class=\"fn\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/Chris_Van_Hollen\" title=\"Chris Van Hollen\">Chris Van Hollen</a> (incumbent) </b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:right;margin-right:0.5em\"><b>535,014 </b>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right;margin-right:0.5em\"><b>80.81 </b>\n</td></tr>\n\n\n<tr class=\"vcard\">\n<td style=\"color:inherit;background-color:#0044C9;width:2px\">\n</td>\n<td class=\"org\" style=\"width:130px\"><a href=\"/wiki/Democratic_Party_(United_States)\" title=\"Democratic Party (United States)\">Democratic</a>\n</td>\n<th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-align: left; font-weight:normal; color:inherit; background:inherit;\" class=\"fn\">Michelle Laurence Smith\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">127,089\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">19.19\n</td></tr>\n\n\n<tr>\n<th scope=\"row\" colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:right;\">Total votes\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:right;\"><b>662,103 </b>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right;\"><b>100.00 </b>\n</td></tr>\n\n</tbody></table>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\";\">\n<caption>Maryland Republican primary<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-MDprimary&#95;177-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-MDprimary-177\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>152<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</caption>\n<tbody><tr>\n<th scope=\"col\" colspan=\"2\" style=\"width: 15em\">Party\n</th>\n<th scope=\"col\" style=\"width: 17em\">Candidate\n</th>\n<th scope=\"col\" style=\"width: 5em\">Votes\n</th>\n<th scope=\"col\" style=\"width: 3.5em\">%\n</th></tr>\n\n\n<tr class=\"vcard\">\n<td style=\"color:inherit;background-color:#E81B23;width:5px\">\n</td>\n<td class=\"org\" style=\"width:130px\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/Republican_Party_(United_States)\" title=\"Republican Party (United States)\">Republican</a></b>\n</td>\n<th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-align:left; font-weight:normal; color:inherit; background:inherit;\" class=\"fn\"><b>Chris Chaffee </b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:right;margin-right:0.5em\"><b>50,514 </b>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right;margin-right:0.5em\"><b>20.78 </b>\n</td></tr>\n\n\n<tr class=\"vcard\">\n<td style=\"color:inherit;background-color:#E81B23;width:2px\">\n</td>\n<td class=\"org\" style=\"width:130px\"><a href=\"/wiki/Republican_Party_(United_States)\" title=\"Republican Party (United States)\">Republican</a>\n</td>\n<th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-align: left; font-weight:normal; color:inherit; background:inherit;\" class=\"fn\">Lorie Friend\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">35,714\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">14.69\n</td></tr>\n\n\n<tr class=\"vcard\">\n<td style=\"color:inherit;background-color:#E81B23;width:2px\">\n</td>\n<td class=\"org\" style=\"width:130px\"><a href=\"/wiki/Republican_Party_(United_States)\" title=\"Republican Party (United States)\">Republican</a>\n</td>\n<th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-align: left; font-weight:normal; color:inherit; background:inherit;\" class=\"fn\">John Thormann\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">33,290\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">13.69\n</td></tr>\n\n\n<tr class=\"vcard\">\n<td style=\"color:inherit;background-color:#E81B23;width:2px\">\n</td>\n<td class=\"org\" style=\"width:130px\"><a href=\"/wiki/Republican_Party_(United_States)\" title=\"Republican Party (United States)\">Republican</a>\n</td>\n<th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-align: left; font-weight:normal; color:inherit; background:inherit;\" class=\"fn\">Joseph Perez\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">26,359\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">10.84\n</td></tr>\n\n\n<tr class=\"vcard\">\n<td style=\"color:inherit;background-color:#E81B23;width:2px\">\n</td>\n<td class=\"org\" style=\"width:130px\"><a href=\"/wiki/Republican_Party_(United_States)\" title=\"Republican Party (United States)\">Republican</a>\n</td>\n<th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-align: left; font-weight:normal; color:inherit; background:inherit;\" class=\"fn\">George Davis\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">21,095\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">8.68\n</td></tr>\n\n\n<tr class=\"vcard\">\n<td style=\"color:inherit;background-color:#E81B23;width:2px\">\n</td>\n<td class=\"org\" style=\"width:130px\"><a href=\"/wiki/Republican_Party_(United_States)\" title=\"Republican Party (United States)\">Republican</a>\n</td>\n<th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-align: left; font-weight:normal; color:inherit; background:inherit;\" class=\"fn\">James Tarantin\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">20,514\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">8.44\n</td></tr>\n\n\n<tr class=\"vcard\">\n<td style=\"color:inherit;background-color:#E81B23;width:2px\">\n</td>\n<td class=\"org\" style=\"width:130px\"><a href=\"/wiki/Republican_Party_(United_States)\" title=\"Republican Party (United States)\">Republican</a>\n</td>\n<th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-align: left; font-weight:normal; color:inherit; background:inherit;\" class=\"fn\">Reba Hawkins\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">18,057\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">7.43\n</td></tr>\n\n\n<tr class=\"vcard\">\n<td style=\"color:inherit;background-color:#E81B23;width:2px\">\n</td>\n<td class=\"org\" style=\"width:130px\"><a href=\"/wiki/Republican_Party_(United_States)\" title=\"Republican Party (United States)\">Republican</a>\n</td>\n<th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-align: left; font-weight:normal; color:inherit; background:inherit;\" class=\"fn\">Jon McGreevey\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">14,128\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">5.81\n</td></tr>\n\n\n<tr class=\"vcard\">\n<td style=\"color:inherit;background-color:#E81B23;width:2px\">\n</td>\n<td class=\"org\" style=\"width:130px\"><a href=\"/wiki/Republican_Party_(United_States)\" title=\"Republican Party (United States)\">Republican</a>\n</td>\n<th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-align: left; font-weight:normal; color:inherit; background:inherit;\" class=\"fn\">Todd Puglisi\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">13,550\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">5.57\n</td></tr>\n\n\n<tr class=\"vcard\">\n<td style=\"color:inherit;background-color:#E81B23;width:2px\">\n</td>\n<td class=\"org\" style=\"width:130px\"><a href=\"/wiki/Republican_Party_(United_States)\" title=\"Republican Party (United States)\">Republican</a>\n</td>\n<th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-align: left; font-weight:normal; color:inherit; background:inherit;\" class=\"fn\">Nnabu Eze\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">9,917\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">4.08\n</td></tr>\n\n\n<tr>\n<th scope=\"row\" colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:right;\">Total votes\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:right;\"><b>243,138 </b>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right;\"><b>100.00 </b>