yle=\"text-align: right; margin-right: 0.5em\">34.07%\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: right; margin-right: 0.5em\">−1.60\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n<tr class=\"vcard\">\n<td style=\"color:inherit;background-color: white; width: 2px;\">\n</td>\n<td class=\"org\" colspan=\"2\"><a href=\"/wiki/Write-in_candidate\" title=\"Write-in candidate\">Write-in</a>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right;\">3,146\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right;\">0.16%\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right;\">+0.02\n</td></tr>\n\n<tr>\n<th scope=\"col\" colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:right;\">Total votes\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:right;\"><b>2,002,336 </b>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right;\"><b>100.0% </b>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right;\">\n</td></tr>\n\n\n<tr>\n<td style=\"color:inherit;background-color: #0044C9;\">\n</td>\n<th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-align:left; font-weight:normal; color:inherit; background:inherit;\" colspan=\"5\"><a href=\"/wiki/Democratic_Party_(United_States)\" title=\"Democratic Party (United States)\">Democratic</a> <b>hold</b>\n</th></tr>\n\n\n</tbody></table>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\" class=\"\"></div>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Missouri\">Missouri</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=2022_United_States_Senate_elections&amp;action=edit&amp;section=36\" title=\"Edit section: Missouri\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1358620234\" /><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1315121714\" /><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1152813436\" /><table class=\"infobox ib-election infobox-table\" style=\"width:300px\"><caption class=\"infobox-title summary\">Missouri election</caption><tbody><tr><td colspan=\"2\" class=\"infobox-subheader\"><span class=\"flagicon\"><span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/5a/Flag_of_Missouri.svg/60px-Flag_of_Missouri.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"29\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/5a/Flag_of_Missouri.svg/120px-Flag_of_Missouri.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"2400\" data-file-height=\"1400\" /></span></span></span><hr /></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\" class=\"infobox-subheader\"><div style=\"width:100%\"><div style=\"float: left; text-align:left;padding-right:0.5em;width:20%;\" class=\"noprint\">&#8592;&#160;<a href=\"/wiki/2016_United_States_Senate_election_in_Missouri\" title=\"2016 United States Senate election in Missouri\">2016</a></div><div style=\"float: right; text-align:right;padding-left:0.5em;width:20%;\" class=\"noprint\"><a href=\"/wiki/2028_United_States_Senate_election_in_Missouri\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2028 United States Senate election in Missouri\">2028</a>&#160;&#8594;</div></div></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\" class=\"infobox-full-data\">\n<table style=\"background:transparent; color: inherit; width:100%;\">\n\n\n\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>&#160;\n</td>\n<td class=\"notheme\" style=\"text-align:center;border-bottom: 6px solid #E81B23;\"><span class=\"notpageimage noresize\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Eric_Schmitt_official_photo_(cropped).jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/75/Eric_Schmitt_official_photo_%28cropped%29.jpg/120px-Eric_Schmitt_official_photo_%28cropped%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"102\" height=\"136\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/75/Eric_Schmitt_official_photo_%28cropped%29.jpg/250px-Eric_Schmitt_official_photo_%28cropped%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"711\" data-file-height=\"948\" /></a></span>\n</td>\n<td class=\"notheme\" style=\"text-align:center;border-bottom: 6px solid #0044C9;\"><span class=\"notpageimage noresize\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Trudy_Busch_Valentine_(1).jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/84/Trudy_Busch_Valentine_%281%29.jpg/120px-Trudy_Busch_Valentine_%281%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"102\" height=\"136\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/84/Trudy_Busch_Valentine_%281%29.jpg/250px-Trudy_Busch_Valentine_%281%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"874\" data-file-height=\"1166\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:75px;text-align:left\">Nominee\n</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/Eric_Schmitt\" title=\"Eric Schmitt\">Eric Schmitt</a></b>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">Trudy Busch Valentine\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:75px;text-align:left\">Party\n</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><a href=\"/wiki/Republican_Party_(United_States)\" title=\"Republican Party (United States)\">Republican</a>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><a href=\"/wiki/Democratic_Party_(United_States)\" title=\"Democratic Party (United States)\">Democratic</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:75px;text-align:left\">Popular&#160;vote\n</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><b>1,146,966</b>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">872,694\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:75px;text-align:left\">Percentage\n</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><b>55.4%</b>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">42.2%\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n</tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\" class=\"infobox-full-data\"><hr /><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:2022_United_States_Senate_election_in_Missouri_results_map_by_county.svg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/69/2022_United_States_Senate_election_in_Missouri_results_map_by_county.svg/330px-2022_United_States_Senate_election_in_Missouri_results_map_by_county.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"300\" height=\"266\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/69/2022_United_States_Senate_election_in_Missouri_results_map_by_county.svg/960px-2022_United_States_Senate_election_in_Missouri_results_map_by_county.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"810\" data-file-height=\"717\" /></a></span><div>County results<br /><b>Schmitt:</b> <span style=\"margin:0px; font-size:90%;\"><span style=\"border:none; background-color:#ffb2b2; color:#ffb2b2;\">&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;</span>&#160;40–50%</span> <span style=\"margin:0px; font-size:90%;\"><span style=\"border:none; background-color:#e27f7f; color:#e27f7f;\">&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;</span>&#160;50–60%</span> <span style=\"margin:0px; font-size:90%;\"><span style=\"border:none; background-color:#d75d5d; color:#d75d5d;\">&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;</span>&#160;60–70%</span> <span style=\"margin:0px; font-size:90%;\"><span style=\"border:none; background-color:#d72f30; color:#d72f30;\">&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;</span>&#160;70–80%</span> <span style=\"margin:0px; font-size:90%;\"><span style=\"border:none; background-color:#c21b18; color:#c21b18;\">&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;</span>&#160;80–90%</span><br /><b>Busch Valentine:</b>  <span style=\"margin:0px; font-size:90%;\"><span style=\"border:none; background-color:#7996e2; color:#7996e2;\">&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;</span>&#160;50–60%</span> <span style=\"margin:0px; font-size:90%;\"><span style=\"border:none; background-color:#6674de; color:#6674de;\">&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;</span>&#160;60–70%</span> <span style=\"margin:0px; font-size:90%;\"><span style=\"border:none; background-color:#3933E5; color:#3933E5;\">&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;</span>&#160;80–90%</span></div></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\" class=\"infobox-full-data\"><hr />\n<table role=\"presentation\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"background:transparent; color: inherit; width:100%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"width:50%; text-align:left;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/List_of_United_States_senators_from_Missouri\" title=\"List of United States senators from Missouri\">U.S. senator</a> before election</b><br />\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/Roy_Blunt\" title=\"Roy Blunt\">Roy Blunt</a><br />\n<a href=\"/wiki/Republican_Party_(United_States)\" title=\"Republican Party (United States)\">Republican</a>\n</p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:50%; text-align:right;\"><b>Elected U.S. Senator</b> <br />\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/Eric_Schmitt\" title=\"Eric Schmitt\">Eric Schmitt</a><br />\n<a href=\"/wiki/Republican_Party_(United_States)\" title=\"Republican Party (United States)\">Republican</a>\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table>\n<link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1368532237\" /><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote navigation-not-searchable\">Main article: <a href=\"/wiki/2022_United_States_Senate_election_in_Missouri\" title=\"2022 United States Senate election in Missouri\">2022 United States Senate election in Missouri</a></div>\n<link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1368532237\" /><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote navigation-not-searchable\">See also: <a href=\"/wiki/List_of_United_States_senators_from_Missouri\" title=\"List of United States senators from Missouri\">List of United States senators from Missouri</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/2022_United_States_House_of_Representatives_elections_in_Missouri\" title=\"2022 United States House of Representatives elections in Missouri\">2022 United States House of Representatives elections in Missouri</a></div>\n<p>Two-term Republican <a href=\"/wiki/Roy_Blunt\" title=\"Roy Blunt\">Roy Blunt</a> was <a href=\"/wiki/2016_United_States_Senate_election_in_Missouri\" title=\"2016 United States Senate election in Missouri\">re-elected in 2016</a> with 49.2% of the vote. He did not seek re-election.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-auto&#95;66-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-auto-66\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>44<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</p><p>State attorney general <a href=\"/wiki/Eric_Schmitt\" title=\"Eric Schmitt\">Eric Schmitt</a> defeated former governor <a href=\"/wiki/Eric_Greitens\" title=\"Eric Greitens\">Eric Greitens</a><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-179\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-179\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>154<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> and U.S. representatives <a href=\"/wiki/Vicky_Hartzler\" title=\"Vicky Hartzler\">Vicky Hartzler</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Billy_Long\" title=\"Billy Long\">Billy Long</a> in the Republican primary.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-Hartzler&#95;180-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-Hartzler-180\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>155<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-MOprimaryRes&#95;181-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-MOprimaryRes-181\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>156<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-auto16&#95;182-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-auto16-182\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>157<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</p><p><a href=\"/wiki/Anheuser-Busch\" title=\"Anheuser-Busch\">Anheuser-Busch</a> heiress Trudy Busch Valentine<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-183\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-183\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>158<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> defeated Marine veteran <a href=\"/wiki/Lucas_Kunce\" title=\"Lucas Kunce\">Lucas Kunce</a><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-184\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-184\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>159<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> in the Democratic primary.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-MOprimary&#95;185-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-MOprimary-185\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>160<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\";\">\n<caption>Missouri Republican primary<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-MOprimary&#95;185-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-MOprimary-185\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>160<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</caption>\n<tbody><tr>\n<th scope=\"col\" colspan=\"2\" style=\"width: 15em\">Party\n</th>\n<th scope=\"col\" style=\"width: 17em\">Candidate\n</th>\n<th scope=\"col\" style=\"width: 5em\">Votes\n</th>\n<th scope=\"col\" style=\"width: 3.5em\">%\n</th></tr>\n\n\n<tr class=\"vcard\">\n<td style=\"color:inherit;background-color:#E81B23;width:5px\">\n</td>\n<td class=\"org\" style=\"width:130px\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/Republican_Party_(United_States)\" title=\"Republican Party (United States)\">Republican</a></b>\n</td>\n<th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-align:left; font-weight:normal; color:inherit; background:inherit;\" class=\"fn\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/Eric_Schmitt\" title=\"Eric Schmitt\">Eric Schmitt</a> </b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:right;margin-right:0.5em\"><b>299,382 </b>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right;margin-right:0.5em\"><b>45.66 </b>\n</td></tr>\n\n\n<tr class=\"v