<tr><td colspan=\"2\" class=\"infobox-subheader\"><div style=\"width:100%\"><div style=\"float: left; text-align:left;padding-right:0.5em;width:20%;\" class=\"noprint\">&#8592;&#160;<a href=\"/wiki/2016_United_States_Senate_election_in_North_Dakota\" title=\"2016 United States Senate election in North Dakota\">2016</a></div><div style=\"float: right; text-align:right;padding-left:0.5em;width:20%;\" class=\"noprint\"><a href=\"/wiki/2028_United_States_Senate_election_in_North_Dakota\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2028 United States Senate election in North Dakota\">2028</a>&#160;&#8594;</div></div></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\" class=\"infobox-full-data\">\n<table style=\"background:transparent; color: inherit; width:100%;\">\n\n\n\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>&#160;\n</td>\n<td class=\"notheme\" style=\"text-align:center;border-bottom: 6px solid #E81B23;\"><span class=\"notpageimage noresize\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Hoeven_Official_Portrait_2014.JPG\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/6d/Hoeven_Official_Portrait_2014.JPG/120px-Hoeven_Official_Portrait_2014.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"107\" height=\"136\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/6d/Hoeven_Official_Portrait_2014.JPG/250px-Hoeven_Official_Portrait_2014.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"2400\" data-file-height=\"3040\" /></a></span>\n</td>\n<td class=\"notheme\" style=\"text-align:center;border-bottom: 6px solid #0055AA;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/bd/3x4.svg/120px-3x4.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"102\" height=\"136\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/bd/3x4.svg/250px-3x4.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"3\" data-file-height=\"4\" /></span></span>\n</td>\n<td class=\"notheme\" style=\"text-align:center;border-bottom: 6px solid #DCDCDC;\"><span class=\"notpageimage noresize\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Rick_Becker_by_Gage_Skidmore.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/80/Rick_Becker_by_Gage_Skidmore.jpg/120px-Rick_Becker_by_Gage_Skidmore.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"98\" height=\"136\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/80/Rick_Becker_by_Gage_Skidmore.jpg/250px-Rick_Becker_by_Gage_Skidmore.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"3000\" data-file-height=\"4145\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:75px;text-align:left\">Nominee\n</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/John_Hoeven\" title=\"John Hoeven\">John Hoeven</a></b>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">Katrina Christiansen\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><a href=\"/wiki/Rick_Becker\" title=\"Rick Becker\">Rick Becker</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:75px;text-align:left\">Party\n</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><a href=\"/wiki/Republican_Party_(US)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Republican Party (US)\">Republican</a>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><a href=\"/wiki/North_Dakota_Democratic%E2%80%93Nonpartisan_League_Party\" title=\"North Dakota Democratic–Nonpartisan League Party\">Democratic–NPL</a>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><a href=\"/wiki/Independent_politician\" title=\"Independent politician\">Independent</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:75px;text-align:left\">Popular&#160;vote\n</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><b>135,474</b>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">59,995\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">44,406\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:75px;text-align:left\">Percentage\n</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><b>56.4%</b>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">25.0%\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">18.5%\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n</tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\" class=\"infobox-full-data\"><hr /><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:2022_United_States_Senate_election_in_North_Dakota_results_map_by_county.svg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/06/2022_United_States_Senate_election_in_North_Dakota_results_map_by_county.svg/330px-2022_United_States_Senate_election_in_North_Dakota_results_map_by_county.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"300\" height=\"181\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/06/2022_United_States_Senate_election_in_North_Dakota_results_map_by_county.svg/960px-2022_United_States_Senate_election_in_North_Dakota_results_map_by_county.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"810\" data-file-height=\"488\" /></a></span><div>County results<br /><b>Hoeven:</b> <span style=\"margin:0px; font-size:90%;\"><span style=\"border:none; background-color:#ffb2b2; color:#ffb2b2;\">&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;</span>&#160;40–50%</span> <span style=\"margin:0px; font-size:90%;\"><span style=\"border:none; background-color:#d75d5d; color:#d75d5d;\">&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;</span>&#160;60–70%</span> <span style=\"margin:0px; font-size:90%;\"><span style=\"border:none; background-color:#d72f30; color:#d72f30;\">&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;</span>&#160;70–80%</span> <span style=\"margin:0px; font-size:90%;\"><span style=\"border:none; background-color:#c21b18; color:#c21b18;\">&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;</span>&#160;80–90%</span> <span style=\"margin:0px; font-size:90%;\"><span style=\"border:none; background-color:#a80000; color:#a80000;\">&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;</span>&#160;&gt;90%</span><br /><b>Christiansen:</b> <span style=\"margin:0px; font-size:90%;\"><span style=\"border:none; background-color:#A5B0FF; color:#A5B0FF;\">&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;</span>&#160;40–50%</span><span style=\"margin:0px; font-size:90%;\"><span style=\"border:none; background-color:#7996e2; color:#7996e2;\">&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;</span>&#160;50–60%</span></div></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\" class=\"infobox-full-data\"><hr />\n<table role=\"presentation\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"background:transparent; color: inherit; width:100%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"width:50%; text-align:left;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/List_of_United_States_senators_from_North_Dakota\" title=\"List of United States senators from North Dakota\">U.S. senator</a> before election</b><br />\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/John_Hoeven\" title=\"John Hoeven\">John Hoeven</a><br />\n<a href=\"/wiki/Republican_Party_(US)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Republican Party (US)\">Republican</a>\n</p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:50%; text-align:right;\"><b>Elected U.S. Senator</b> <br />\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/John_Hoeven\" title=\"John Hoeven\">John Hoeven</a><br />\n<a href=\"/wiki/Republican_Party_(US)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Republican Party (US)\">Republican</a>\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table>\n<link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1368532237\" /><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote navigation-not-searchable\">Main article: <a href=\"/wiki/2022_United_States_Senate_election_in_North_Dakota\" title=\"2022 United States Senate election in North Dakota\">2022 United States Senate election in North Dakota</a></div>\n<link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1368532237\" /><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote navigation-not-searchable\">See also: <a href=\"/wiki/List_of_United_States_senators_from_North_Dakota\" title=\"List of United States senators from North Dakota\">List of United States senators from North Dakota</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/2022_United_States_House_of_Representatives_election_in_North_Dakota\" title=\"2022 United States House of Representatives election in North Dakota\">2022 United States House of Representatives election in North Dakota</a></div>\n<p>Two-term Republican <a href=\"/wiki/John_Hoeven\" title=\"John Hoeven\">John Hoeven</a> was <a href=\"/wiki/2016_United_States_Senate_election_in_North_Dakota\" title=\"2016 United States Senate election in North Dakota\">re-elected in 2016</a> with 78.5% of the vote. On February 4, 2021, Hoeven campaign spokesman Dan Larson indicated that Hoeven was running for re-election in 2022.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-212\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-212\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>187<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-213\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-213\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>188<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> <a href=\"/wiki/University_of_Jamestown\" title=\"University of Jamestown\">University of Jamestown</a> engineering professor Katrina Christiansen defeated businessman Michael Steele in the Democratic primary election.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-two&#95;democrats&#95;214-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-two_democrats-214\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>189<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> Former <a href=\"/wiki/North_Dakota_House_of_Representatives\" title=\"North Dakota House of Representatives\">state representative</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Rick_Becker\" title=\"Rick Becker\">Rick Becker</a> challenged Hoeven in the Republican primary but withdrew after losing the convention.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-Endorsed&#95;215-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-Endorsed-215\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>190<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</p><p>Hoeven and Christiansen won their respective primaries on June 14.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-216\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-216\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>191<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\";\">\n<caption>North Dakota Republican primary\n</caption>\n<tbody><tr>\n<th scope=\"col\" colspan=\"2\" style=\"width: 15em\">Party\n</th>\n<th scope=\"col\" style=\"width: 17em\">Candidate\n</th>\n<th scope=\"col\" style=\"width: 5em\">Votes\n</th>\n<th scope=\"col\" style=\"width: 3.5em\">%\n</th></tr>\n\n\n<tr class=\"vcard\">\n<td style=\"color:inherit;background-color:#E81B23;width:5px\">\n</td>\n<td class=\"org\" style=\"width:130px\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/Republican_Party_(United_States)\" title=\"Republican Party (United States)\">Republican</a></b>\n</td>\n<th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-align:left; font-weight:normal; color:inherit; background:inherit;\" class=\"fn\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/John_Hoeven\" title=\"John Hoeven\">John Hoeven</a> (incumbent) </b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:right;margin-right:0.5em\"><b>59,529 </b>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right;margin-right:0.5em\"><b>77.83 </b>\n</td></tr>\n\n\n<tr class=\"vcard\">\n<td style=\"color:inherit;background-color:#E81B23;width:2px\">\n</td>\n<td class=\"org\" style=\"width:130px\"><a href=\"/wiki/Republican_Party_(United_States)\" title=\"Republican Party (United States)\">Republican</a>\n</td>\n<th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-align: left; font-weight:normal; color:inherit; background:inherit;\" class=\"fn\">Riley Kuntz\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">16,400\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">21.44\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n<tr class=\"vcard\">\n<td style=\"color:inherit;background-color: #FFFFFF; width: 2px;\">\n</td>\n<td class=\"org\" colspan=\"2\"><a href=\"/wiki/Write-in_candidate\" title=\"Write-in candidate\">Write-in</a>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right;\">557\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right;\">0.73\n</td></tr>\n\n\n<tr>\n<th scope=\"row\" colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:right;\">Total votes\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:right;\"><b>76,486 </b>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right;\"><b>100.00 </b>\n</td></tr>\n\n</tbody></table>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\";\">\n<caption>North Dakota Democratic–NPL primary\n</caption>\n<tbody><tr>\n<th scope=\"col\" colspan=\"2\" style=\"width: 15em\">Party\n</th>\n<th scope=\"col\" style=\"width: 17em\">Candidate\n</th>\n<th scope=\"col\" style=\"width: 5em\">Votes\n</th>\n<th scope=\"col\" style=\"width: 3.5em\">%\n</th></tr>\n\n\n<tr class=\"vcard\">\n<td style=\"color:inherit;background-color:#0055AA;width:5px\">\n</td>\n<td class=\"org\" style=\"width:130px\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/North_Dakota_Democratic%E2%80%93Nonpartisan_League_Party\" title=\"North Dakota Democratic–Nonpartisan League Party\">Democratic–NPL</a></b>\n</td>\n<th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-align:left; font-weight:normal; color:inherit; background:inherit;\" class=\"fn\"><b>Katrina Christiansen </b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:right;margin-right:0.5em\"><b>17,187 </b>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right;margin-right:0.5em\"><b>76.78 </b>\n</td></tr>\n\n\n<tr class=\"vcard\">\n<td style=\"color:inherit;background-color:#0055AA;width:2px\">\n</td>\n<td class=\"org\" style=\"width:130px\"><a href=\"/wiki/North_Dakota_Democratic%E2%80%93Nonpartisan_League_Party\" title=\"North Dakota Democratic–Nonpartisan League Party\">Democratic–NPL</a>\n</td>\n<th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-align: left; font-weight:normal; color:inherit; background:inherit;\" class=\"fn\">Michael Steele\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">5,174\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">23.11\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n<tr class=\"vcard\">\n<td style=\"color:inherit;background-color: #FFFFFF; width: 2px;\">\n</td>\n<td class=\"org\" colspan=\"2\"><a href=\"/wiki/Write-in_candidate\" title=\"Write-in candidate\">Write-in</a>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right;\">24\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right;\">0.11\n</td></tr>\n\n\n<tr>\n<th scope=\"row\" colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:right;\">Total votes\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:right;\"><b>22,385 </b>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right;\"><b>100.00 </b>\n</td></tr>\n\n</tbody></table>\n<table class=\"wikitable plainrowheaders\">\n<caption>North Dakota general election<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-217\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-217\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>192<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</caption>\n<tbody><tr>\n<th scope=\"col\" colspan=\"2\" style=\"width: 130px\">Party\n</th>\n<th scope=\"col\" style=\"width: 17em\">Candidate\n</th>\n<th scope=\"col\" style=\"width: 5em\">Votes\n</th>\n<th scope=\"col\" style=\"width: 3.5em\">%\n</th>\n<th scope=\"col\" style=\"width: 3.5em\"><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1038841319\" /><span class=\"rt-commentedText tooltip tooltip-dotted\" title=\"Change in percentage value since previous election\">±%</span>\n</th></tr>\n\n\n<tr class=\"vcard\">\n<td style=\"color:inherit;background-color:#E81B23; width:5px;\">\n</td>\n<td class=\"org\" style=\"width:130px\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/Republican_Party_(United_States)\" title=\"Republican Party (United States)\">Republican</a></b>\n</td>\n<th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-align:left; font-weight:normal; color:inherit; background:inherit;\" class=\"fn\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/John_Hoeven\" title=\"John Hoeven\">John Hoeven</a> (incumbent) </b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:right; margin-right:0.5em\"><b>135,474 </b>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right; margin-right:0.5em\"><b>56.41% </b>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right; margin-right:0.5em\"><b>−22.07 </b>\n</td></tr>\n\n\n<tr class=\"vcard\">\n<td style=\"color:inherit; background-color: #0055AA; width: 5px;\">\n</td>\n<td class=\"org\" style=\"width: 130px\"><a href=\"/wiki/North_Dakota_Democratic%E2%80%93Nonpartisan_League_Party\" title=\"North Dakota Democratic–Nonpartisan League Party\">Democratic–NPL</a>\n</td>\n<th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-align:left; font-weight:normal; color:inherit; background:inherit;\" class=\"fn\">Katrina Christiansen\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align: right; margin-right: 0.5em\">59,995\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: right; margin-right: 0.5em\">24.98%\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: right; margin-right: 0.5em\">+8.01\n</td></tr>\n\n\n<tr class=\"vcard\">\n<td style=\"color:inherit; background-color: #DCDCDC; width: 5px;\">\n</td>\n<td class=\"org\" style=\"width: 130px\"><a href=\"/wiki/Independent_politician\" title=\"Independent politician\">Independent</a>\n</td>\n<th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-align:left; font-weight:normal; color:inherit; background:inherit;\" class=\"fn\"><a href=\"/wiki/Rick_Becker\" title=\"Rick Becker\">Rick Becker</a>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align: right; margin-right: 0.5em\">44,406\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: right; margin-right: 0.5em\">18.49%\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: right; margin-right: 0.5em\">N/A\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n<tr class=\"vcard\">\n<td style=\"color:inherit;background-color: white; width: 2px;\">\n</td>\n<td class=\"org\" colspan=\"2\"><a href=\"/wiki/Write-in_candidate\" title=\"Write-in candidate\">Write-in</a>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right;\">265\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right;\">0.11%\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right;\">N/A\n</td></tr>\n\n<tr>\n<th scope=\"col\" colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:right;\">Total votes\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:right;\"><b>240,140 </b>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right;\"><b>100.0% </b>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right;\">\n</td></tr>\n\n\n<tr>\n<td style=\"color:inherit;background-color: #E81B23;\"