ckground-color:#E81B23;width:5px\">\n</td>\n<td class=\"org\" style=\"width:130px\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/Republican_Party_(United_States)\" title=\"Republican Party (United States)\">Republican</a></b>\n</td>\n<th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-align:left; font-weight:normal; color:inherit; background:inherit;\" class=\"fn\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/Markwayne_Mullin\" title=\"Markwayne Mullin\">Markwayne Mullin</a> </b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:right;margin-right:0.5em\"><b>183,118 </b>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right;margin-right:0.5em\"><b>65.08 </b>\n</td></tr>\n\n\n<tr class=\"vcard\">\n<td style=\"color:inherit;background-color:#E81B23;width:2px\">\n</td>\n<td class=\"org\" style=\"width:130px\"><a href=\"/wiki/Republican_Party_(United_States)\" title=\"Republican Party (United States)\">Republican</a>\n</td>\n<th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-align: left; font-weight:normal; color:inherit; background:inherit;\" class=\"fn\"><a href=\"/wiki/T._W._Shannon\" title=\"T. W. Shannon\">T. W. Shannon</a>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">98,246\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">34.92\n</td></tr>\n\n\n<tr>\n<th scope=\"row\" colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:right;\">Total votes\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:right;\"><b>281,364 </b>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right;\"><b>100.00 </b>\n</td></tr>\n\n</tbody></table>\n<table class=\"wikitable plainrowheaders\">\n<caption>Oklahoma special general election<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-OKgen&#95;227-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-OKgen-227\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>202<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</caption>\n<tbody><tr>\n<th scope=\"col\" colspan=\"2\" style=\"width: 130px\">Party\n</th>\n<th scope=\"col\" style=\"width: 17em\">Candidate\n</th>\n<th scope=\"col\" style=\"width: 5em\">Votes\n</th>\n<th scope=\"col\" style=\"width: 3.5em\">%\n</th>\n<th scope=\"col\" style=\"width: 3.5em\"><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1038841319\" /><span class=\"rt-commentedText tooltip tooltip-dotted\" title=\"Change in percentage value since previous election\">±%</span>\n</th></tr>\n\n\n<tr class=\"vcard\">\n<td style=\"color:inherit;background-color:#E81B23; width:5px;\">\n</td>\n<td class=\"org\" style=\"width:130px\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/Republican_Party_(United_States)\" title=\"Republican Party (United States)\">Republican</a></b>\n</td>\n<th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-align:left; font-weight:normal; color:inherit; background:inherit;\" class=\"fn\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/Markwayne_Mullin\" title=\"Markwayne Mullin\">Markwayne Mullin</a> </b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:right; margin-right:0.5em\"><b>710,643 </b>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right; margin-right:0.5em\"><b>61.77% </b>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right; margin-right:0.5em\"><b>−1.14 </b>\n</td></tr>\n\n\n<tr class=\"vcard\">\n<td style=\"color:inherit; background-color: #0044C9; width: 5px;\">\n</td>\n<td class=\"org\" style=\"width: 130px\"><a href=\"/wiki/Democratic_Party_(United_States)\" title=\"Democratic Party (United States)\">Democratic</a>\n</td>\n<th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-align:left; font-weight:normal; color:inherit; background:inherit;\" class=\"fn\"><a href=\"/wiki/Kendra_Horn\" title=\"Kendra Horn\">Kendra Horn</a>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align: right; margin-right: 0.5em\">405,389\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: right; margin-right: 0.5em\">35.24%\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: right; margin-right: 0.5em\">+2.49\n</td></tr>\n\n\n<tr class=\"vcard\">\n<td style=\"color:inherit; background-color: #fed000; width: 5px;\">\n</td>\n<td class=\"org\" style=\"width: 130px\"><a href=\"/wiki/Libertarian_Party_(United_States)\" title=\"Libertarian Party (United States)\">Libertarian</a>\n</td>\n<th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-align:left; font-weight:normal; color:inherit; background:inherit;\" class=\"fn\">Robert Murphy\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align: right; margin-right: 0.5em\">17,386\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: right; margin-right: 0.5em\">1.51%\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: right; margin-right: 0.5em\">−0.70\n</td></tr>\n\n\n<tr class=\"vcard\">\n<td style=\"color:inherit; background-color: #DCDCDC; width: 5px;\">\n</td>\n<td class=\"org\" style=\"width: 130px\"><a href=\"/wiki/Independent_politician\" title=\"Independent politician\">Independent</a>\n</td>\n<th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-align:left; font-weight:normal; color:inherit; background:inherit;\" class=\"fn\">Ray Woods\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align: right; margin-right: 0.5em\">17,063\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: right; margin-right: 0.5em\">1.48%\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: right; margin-right: 0.5em\">N/A\n</td></tr>\n\n\n<tr>\n<th scope=\"col\" colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:right;\">Total votes\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:right;\"><b>1,150,481 </b>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right;\"><b>100.0% </b>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right;\">\n</td></tr>\n\n\n<tr>\n<td style=\"color:inherit;background-color: #E81B23;\">\n</td>\n<th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-align:left; font-weight:normal; color:inherit; background:inherit;\" colspan=\"5\"><a href=\"/wiki/Republican_Party_(United_States)\" title=\"Republican Party (United States)\">Republican</a> <b>hold</b>\n</th></tr>\n\n\n</tbody></table>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\" class=\"\"></div>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Oregon\">Oregon</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=2022_United_States_Senate_elections&amp;action=edit&amp;section=46\" title=\"Edit section: Oregon\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1358620234\" /><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1315121714\" /><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1152813436\" /><table class=\"infobox ib-election infobox-table\" style=\"width:300px\"><caption class=\"infobox-title summary\">Oregon election</caption><tbody><tr><td colspan=\"2\" class=\"infobox-subheader\"><span class=\"flagicon\"><span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b9/Flag_of_Oregon.svg/60px-Flag_of_Oregon.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"33\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b9/Flag_of_Oregon.svg/120px-Flag_of_Oregon.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"768\" data-file-height=\"512\" /></span></span></span><hr /></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\" class=\"infobox-subheader\"><div style=\"width:100%\"><div style=\"float: left; text-align:left;padding-right:0.5em;width:20%;\" class=\"noprint\">&#8592;&#160;<a href=\"/wiki/2016_United_States_Senate_election_in_Oregon\" title=\"2016 United States Senate election in Oregon\">2016</a></div><div style=\"float: right; text-align:right;padding-left:0.5em;width:20%;\" class=\"noprint\"><a href=\"/wiki/2028_United_States_Senate_election_in_Oregon\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2028 United States Senate election in Oregon\">2028</a>&#160;&#8594;</div></div></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\" class=\"infobox-full-data\">\n<table style=\"background:transparent; color: inherit; width:100%;\">\n\n\n\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>&#160;\n</td>\n<td class=\"notheme\" style=\"text-align:center;border-bottom: 6px solid #0044C9;\"><span class=\"notpageimage noresize\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Ron_Wyden_117th_Congress_3x4.jpeg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/be/Ron_Wyden_117th_Congress_3x4.jpeg/120px-Ron_Wyden_117th_Congress_3x4.jpeg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"102\" height=\"136\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/be/Ron_Wyden_117th_Congress_3x4.jpeg/250px-Ron_Wyden_117th_Congress_3x4.jpeg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"1680\" data-file-height=\"2240\" /></a></span>\n</td>\n<td class=\"notheme\" style=\"text-align:center;border-bottom: 6px solid #E81B23;\"><span class=\"notpageimage noresize\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Jo_Rae_Perkins_senate_forum_2014_(cropped).png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/4a/Jo_Rae_Perkins_senate_forum_2014_%28cropped%29.png/120px-Jo_Rae_Perkins_senate_forum_2014_%28cropped%29.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"105\" height=\"136\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/4a/Jo_Rae_Perkins_senate_forum_2014_%28cropped%29.png/250px-Jo_Rae_Perkins_senate_forum_2014_%28cropped%29.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"432\" data-file-height=\"558\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:75px;text-align:left\">Nominee\n</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/Ron_Wyden\" title=\"Ron Wyden\">Ron Wyden</a></b>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><a href=\"/wiki/Jo_Rae_Perkins\" title=\"Jo Rae Perkins\">Jo Rae Perkins</a>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:75px;text-align:left\">Party\n</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><a href=\"/wiki/Democratic_Party_(US)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Democratic Party (US)\">Democratic</a>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><a href=\"/wiki/Republican_Party_(US)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Republican Party (US)\">Republican</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:75px;text-align:left\">Popular&#160;vote\n</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><b>1,076,424</b>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">788,991\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:75px;text-align:left\">Percentage\n</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><b>55.8%</b>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">40.9%\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n</tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\" class=\"infobox-full-data\"><hr /><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:2022_United_States_Senate_election_in_Oregon_results_map_by_county.svg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/76/2022_United_States_Senate_election_in_Oregon_results_map_by_county.svg/330px-2022_United_States_Senate_election_in_Oregon_results_map_by_county.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"300\" height=\"225\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/76/2022_United_States_Senate_election_in_Oregon_results_map_by_county.svg/960px-2022_United_States_Senate_election_in_Oregon_results_map_by_county.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"810\" data-file-height=\"608\" /></a></span><div>County results<br /><b>Wyden:</b> <span style=\"margin:0px; font-size:90%;\"><span style=\"border:none; background-color:#a5b0ff; color:#a5b0ff;\">&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;</span>&#160;40–50%</span> <span style=\"margin:0px; font-size:90%;\"><span style=\"border:none; background-color:#7996e2; color:#7996e2;\">&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;</span>&#160;50–60%</span> <span style=\"margin:0px; font-size:90%;\"><span style=\"border:none; background-color:#6674de; color:#6674de;\">&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;</span>&#160;60–70%</span> <span style=\"margin:0px; font-size:90%;\"><span style=\"border:none; background-color:#584cde; color:#584cde;\">&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;</span>&#160;70–80%</span><br /><b>Perkins:</b> <span style=\"margin:0px; font-size:90%;\"><span style=\"border:none; background-color:#ffb2b2; color:#ffb2b2;\">&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;</span>&#160;40–50%</span> <span style=\"margin:0px; font-size:90%;\"><span style=\"border:none; background-color:#e27f7f; color:#e27f7f;\">&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;</span>&#160;50–60%</span> <span style=\"margin:0px; font-size:90%;\"><span style=\"border:none; background-color:#d75d5d; color:#d75d5d;\">&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;</span>&#160;60–70%</span> <span style=\"margin:0px; font-size:90%;\"><span style=\"border:none; background-color:#d72f30; color:#d72f30;\">&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;</span>&#160;70–80%</span></div></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\" class=\"infobox-full-data\"><hr />\n<table role=\"presentation\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"background:transparent; color: inherit; width:100%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"width:50%; text-align:left;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/List_of_United_States_senators_from_Oregon\" title=\"List of United States senators from Oregon\">U.S. senator</a> before election</b><br />\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/Ron_Wyden\" title=\"Ron Wyden\">Ron Wyden</a><br />\n<a href=\"/wiki/Democratic_Party_(US)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Democratic Party (US)\">Democratic</a>\n</p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:50%; text-align:right;\"><b>Elected U.S. Senator</b> <br />\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/Ron_Wyden\" title=\"Ron Wyden\">Ron Wyden</a><br />\n<a href=\"/wiki/Democratic_Party_(US)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Democratic Party (US)\">Democratic</a>\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table>\n<link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1368532237\" /><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote navigation-not-searchable\">Main article: <a href=\"/wiki/2022_United_States_Senate_election_in_Oregon\" title=\"2022 United States Senate election in Oregon\">2022 United States Senate election in Oregon</a></div>\n<link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1368532237\" /><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote navigation-not-searchable\">See also: <a href=\"/wiki/List_of_United_States_senators_from_Oregon\" title=\"List of United States senators from Oregon\">List of United States senators from Oregon</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/2022_United_States_House_of_Representatives_elections_in_Oregon\" title=\"2022 United States House of Representatives elections in Oregon\">2022 United States House of Representatives elections in Oregon</a></div>\n<p>Incumbent <a href=\"/wiki/Democratic_Party_(United_States)\" title=\"Democratic Party (United States)\">Democratic</a> U.S. Senator <a href=\"/wiki/Ron_Wyden\" title=\"Ron Wyden\">Ron Wyden</a>, who was first elected in a <a href=\"/wiki/1996_United_States_Senate_special_election_in_Oregon\" title=\"1996 United States Senate special election in Oregon\">1996 special election</a>, ran for a fifth full term.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-OPB&#95;234-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-OPB-234\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>209<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> <a href=\"/wiki/Jo_Rae_Perkins\" title=\"Jo Rae Perkins\">Jo Rae Perkins</a>, who unsuccessfully ran for Oregon's other Senate seat in <a href=\"/wiki/2020_United_States_Senate_election_in_Oregon\" title=\"2020 United States Senate election in Oregon\">2020</a>, won the <a href=\"/wiki/Republican_Party_(United_States)\" title=\"Republican Party (United States)\">Republican</a> primary with 33.3% of the vote.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-235\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-235\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>210<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> The four candidates filing with the Oregon Secretary of State for this election included Chris Henry of the <a href=\"/wiki/Oregon_Progressive_Party\" title=\"Oregon Progressive Party\">Oregon Progressive Party</a> and Dan Pulju of the <a href=\"/wiki/Pacific_Green_Party\" title=\"Pacific Green Party\">Pacific Green Party</a>.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-236\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-236\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>211<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</p><p>Wyden ultimately won the election with 55.8% of the statewide vote. This is the first victory of Wyden's since 1996 where none of the following counties went Democratic in a Senate Class III election: <a href=\"/wiki/Gilliam_County,_Oregon\" title=\"Gilliam County, Oregon\">Gilliam</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Jackson_County,_Oregon\" title=\"Jackson County, Oregon\">Jackson</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Marion_County,_Oregon\" title=\"Marion County, Oregon\">Marion</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Polk_County,_Oregon\" title=\"Polk County, Oregon\">Polk</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Wasco_County,_Oregon\" title=\"Wasco County, Oregon\">Wasco</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Yamhill_County,_Oregon\" title=\"Yamhill County, Oregon\">Yamhill</a>. It is also the first time <a href=\"/wiki/Columbia_County,_Oregon\" title=\"Columbia County, Oregon\">Columbia County</a> supported the Republican nominee over Wyden.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-237\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-237\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>212<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\";\">\n<caption>Oregon Democratic primary<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-ORprimary&#95;238-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-ORprimary-238\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>213<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</caption>\n<tbody><tr>\n<th scope=\"col\" colspan=\"2\" style=\"width: 15em\">Party\n</th>\n<th scope=\"col\" style=\"width: 17em\">Candidate\n</th>\n<th scope=\"col\" style=\"width: 5em\">Votes\n</th>\n<th scope=\"col\" style=\"width: 3.5em\">%\n</th></tr>\n\n\n<tr class=\"vcard\">\n<td style=\"color:inherit;background-color:#0044C9;width:5px\">\n</td>\n<td class=\"org\" style=\"width:130px\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/Democratic_Party_(United_States)\" title=\"Democratic Party (United States)\">Democratic</a></b>\n</td>\n<th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-align:left; font-weight:normal; color:inherit; background:inherit;\" class=\"fn\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/Ron_Wyden\" title=\"Ron Wyden\">Ron Wyden</a> (incumbent) </b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:right;margin-right:0.5em\"><b>439,665 </b>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right;margin-right:0.5em\"><b>89.38 </b>\n</td></tr>\n\n\n<tr class=\"vcard\">\n<td style=\"color:inherit;background-color:#0044C9;width:2px\">\n</td>\n<td class=\"org\" style=\"width:130px\"><a href=\"/wiki/Democratic_Party_(United_States)\" title=\"Democratic Party (United States)\">Democratic</a>\n</td>\n<th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-align: left; font-weight:normal; color:inherit; background:inherit;\" class=\"fn\">William E. Barlow III\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">35,025\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">7.12\n</td></tr>\n\n\n<tr class=\"vcard\">\n<td style=\"color:inherit;background-color:#0044C9;width:2px\">\n</td>\n<td class=\"org\" style=\"width:130px\"><a href=\"/wiki/Democratic_Party_(United_States)\" title=\"Democratic Party (United States)\">Democratic</a>\n</td>\n<th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-align: left; font-weight:normal; color:inherit; background:inherit;\" class=\"fn\">Brent Thompson\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">17,197\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">3.50\n</td></tr>\n\n\n<tr>\n<th scope=\"row\" colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:right;\">Total votes\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:right;\"><b>491,887 </b>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right;\"><b>100.00 </b>\n</td></tr>\n\n</tbody></table>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\";\">\n<caption>Oregon Republican primary<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-ORprimary&#95;238-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-ORprimary-238\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>213<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</caption>\n<tbody><tr>\n<th scope=\"col\" colspan=\"2\" style=\"width: 15em\">Party\n</th>\n<th scope=\"col\" style=\"width: 17em\">Candidate\n</th>\n<th scope=\"col\" style=\"width: 5em\">Votes\n</th>\n<th scope=\"col\" style=\"width: 3.5em\">%\n</th></tr>\n\n\n<tr class=\"vcard\">\n<td style=\"color:inherit;background-color:#E81B23;width:5px\">\n</td>\n<td class=\"org\" style=\"width:130px\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/Republican_Party_(United_States)\" title=\"Republican Party (United States)\">Republican</a></b>\n</td>\n<th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-align:left; font-weight:normal; color:inherit; background:inherit;\" class=\"fn\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/Jo_Rae_Perkins\" title=\"Jo Rae Perkins\">Jo Rae Perkins</a> </b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:right;margin-right:0.5em\"><b>115,701 </b>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right;margin-right:0.5em\"><b>33.32 </b>\n</td></tr>\n\n\n<tr class=\"vcard\">\n<td style=\"color:inherit;background-color:#E81B23;width:2px\">\n</td>\n<td class=\"org\" style=\"width:130px\"><a href=\"/wiki/Republican_Party_(United_States)\" title=\"Republican Party (United States)\">Republican</a>\n</td>\n<th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-align: left; font-weight:normal; color:inherit; background:inherit;\" class=\"fn\">Darin Harbick\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">107,506\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">30.96\n</td></tr>\n\n\n<tr class=\"vcard\">\n<td style=\"color:inherit;background-color:#E81B23;width:2px\">\n</td>\n<td class=\"org\" style=\"width:130px\"><a href=\"/wiki/Republican_Party_(United_States)\" title=\"Republican Party (United States)\">Republican</a>\n</td>\n<th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-align: left; font-weight:normal; color:inherit; background:inherit;\" class=\"fn\">Sam Palmer\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">42,703\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">12.30\n</td></tr>\n\n\n<tr class=\"vcard\">\n<td style=\"color:inherit;background-color:#E81B23;width:2px\">\n</td>\n<td class=\"org\" style=\"width:130px\"><a href=\"/wiki/Republican_Party_(United_States)\" title=\"Republican Party (United States)\">Republican</a>\n</td>\n<th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-align: left; font-weight:normal; color:inherit; background:inherit;\" class=\"fn\">Jason Beebe\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">39,456\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">11.36\n</td></tr>\n\n\n<tr class=\"vcard\">\n<td style=\"color:inherit;background-color:#E81B23;width:2px\">\n</td>\n<td class=\"org\" style=\"width:130px\"><a href=\"/wiki/Republican_Party_(United_States)\" title=\"Republican Party (United States)\">Republican</a>\n</td>\n<th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-align: left; font-weight:normal; color:inherit; background:inherit;\" class=\"fn\">Christopher C. Christensen\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">28,433\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">8.19\n</td></tr>\n\n\n<tr class=\"vcard\">\n<td style=\"color:inherit;background-color:#E81B23;width:2px\">\n</td>\n<td class=\"org\" style=\"width:130px\"><a href=\"/wiki/Republican_Party_(United_States)\" title=\"Republican Party (United States)\">Republican</a>\n</td>\n<th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-align: left; font-weight:normal; color:inherit; background:inherit;\" class=\"fn\">Robert M. Fleming\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">6,821\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">1.96\n</td></tr>\n\n\n<tr class=\"vcard\">\n<td style=\"color:inherit;background-color:#E81B23;width:2px\">\n</td>\n<td class=\"org\" style=\"width:130px\"><a href=\"/wiki/Republican_Party_(United_States)\" title=\"Republican Party (United States)\">Republican</a>\n</td>\n<th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-align: left; font-weight:normal; color:inherit; background:inherit;\" class=\"fn\">Ibra A. Taher\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">6,659\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">1.92\n</td></tr>\n\n\n<tr>\n<th scope=\"row\" colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:right;\">Total votes\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:right;\"><b>347,279 </b>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right;\"><b>100.00 </b>\n</td></tr>\n\n</tbody></table>\n<table class=\"wikitable plainrowheaders\">\n<caption>Oregon general election<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-239\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-239\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>214<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</caption>\n<tbody><tr>\n<th scope=\"col\" colspan=\"2\" style=\"width: 130px\">Party\n</th>\n<th scope=\"col\" style=\"width: 17em\">Candidate\n</th>\n<th scope=\"col\" style=\"width: 5em\">Votes\n</th>\n<th scope=\"col\" style=\"width: 3.5em\">%\n</th>\n<th scope=\"col\" style=\"width: 3.5em\"><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1038841319\" /><span class=\"rt-commentedText tooltip tooltip-dotted\" title=\"Change in percentage value since previous election\">±%</span>\n</th></tr>\n\n\n<tr class=\"vcard\">\n<td style=\"color:inherit;background-color:#0044C9; width:5px;\">\n</td>\n<td class=\"org\" style=\"width:130px\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/Democratic_Party_(United_States)\" title=\"Democratic Party (United States)\">Democratic</a></b>\n</td>\n<th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-align:left; font-weight:normal; color:inherit; background:inherit;\" class=\"fn\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/Ron_Wyden\" title=\"Ron Wyden\">Ron Wyden</a> (incumbent) </b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:right; margin-right:0.5em\"><b>1,076,424 </b>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right; margin-right:0.5em\"><b>55.83% </b>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right; margin-right:0.5em\"><b>−0.77 </b>\n</td></tr>\n\n\n<tr class=\"vcard\">\n<td style=\"color:inherit; background-color: #E81B23; width: 5px;\">\n</td>\n<td class=\"org\" style=\"width: 130px\"><a href=\"/wiki/Republican_Party_(United_States)\" title=\"Republican Party (United States)\">Republican</a>\n</td>\n<th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-align:left; font-weight:normal; color:inherit; background:inherit;\" class=\"fn\"><a href=\"/wiki/Jo_Rae_Perkins\" title=\"Jo Rae Perkins\">Jo Rae Perkins</a>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align: right; margin-right: 0.5em\">788,991\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: right; margin-right: 0.5em\">40.92%\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: right; margin-right: 0.5em\">+7.57\n</td></tr>\n\n\n<tr class=\"vcard\">\n<td style=\"color:inherit; background-color: #5FD170; width: 5px;\">\n</td>\n<td class=\"org\" style=\"width: 130px\"><a href=\"/wiki/Oregon_Progressive_Party\" title=\"Oregon Progressive Party\">Progressive</a>\n</td>\n<th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-align:left; font-weight:normal; color:inherit; background:inherit;\" class=\"fn\">Chris Henry\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align: right; margin-right: 0.5em\">36,883\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: right; margin-right: 0.5em\">1.91%\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: right; margin-right: 0.5em\">N/A\n</td></tr>\n\n\n<tr class=\"vcard\">\n<td style=\"color:inherit; background-color: #90EE90; width: 5px;\">\n</td>\n<td class=\"org\" style=\"width: 130px\"><a href=\"/wiki/Pacific_Green_Party\" title=\"Pacific Green Party\">Pacific Green</a>\n</td>\n<th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-align:left; font-weight:normal; color:inherit; background:inherit;\" class=\"fn\">Dan Pulju\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align: right; margin-right: 0.5em\">23,454\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: right; margin-right: 0.5em\">1.22%\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: right; margin-right: 0.5em\">−1.28\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n<tr class=\"vcard\">\n<td style=\"color:inherit;background-color: white; width: 2px;\">\n</td>\n<td class=\"org\" colspan=\"2\"><a href=\"/wiki/Write-in_candidate\" title=\"Write-in candidate\">Write-in</a>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right;\">2,197\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right;\">0.11%\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right;\">+0.01\n</td></tr>\n\n<tr>\n<th scope=\"col\" colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:right;\">Total votes\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:right;\"><b>1,927,949 </b>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right;\"><b>100.0% </b>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right;\">\n</td></tr>\n\n\n<tr>\n<td style=\"color:inherit;background-color: #0044C9;\">\n</td>\n<th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-align:left; font-weight:normal; color:inherit; background:inherit;\" colspan=\"5\"><a href=\"/wiki/Democratic_Party_(United_States)\" title=\"Democratic Party (United States)\">Democratic</a> <b>hold</b>\n</th></tr>\n\n\n</tbody></table>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\" class=\"\"></div>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Pennsylvania\">Pennsylvania</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=2022_United_States_Senate_elections&amp;action=edit&amp;section=47\" title=\"Edit section: Pennsylvania\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1358620234\" /><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1315121714\" /><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1152813436\" /><table class=\"infobox ib-election infobox-table\" style=\"width:300px\"><caption class=\"infobox-title summary\">Pennsylvania election</caption><tbody><tr><td colspan=\"2\" class=\"infobox-subheader\"><span class=\"flagicon\"><span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f7/Flag_of_Pennsylvania.svg/60px-Flag_of_Pennsylvania.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"36\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f7/Flag_of_Pennsylvania.svg/120px-Flag_of_Pennsylvania.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"740\" data-file-height=\"540\" /></span></span></span><hr /></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\" class=\"infobox-subheader\"><div style=\"width:100%\"><div style=\"float: left; text-align:left;padding-right:0.5em;width:20%;\" class=\"noprint\">&#8592;&#160;<a href=\"/wiki/2016_United_States_Senate_election_in_Pennsylvania\" title=\"2016 United States Senate election in Pennsylvania\">2016</a></div><div style=\"float: right; text-align:right;padding-left:0.5em;width:20%;\" class=\"noprint\"><a href=\"/wiki/2028_United_States_Senate_election_in_Pennsylvania\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2028 United States Senate election in Pennsylvania\">2028</a>&#160;&#8594;</div></div></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\" class=\"infobox-full-data\">\n<table style=\"background:transparent; color: inherit; width:100%;\">\n\n\n\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>&#160;\n</td>\n<td class=\"notheme\" style=\"text-align:center;border-bottom: 6px solid #0044C9;\"><span class=\"notpageimage noresize\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:John_Fetterman_official_portrait_(3x4).jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/31/John_Fetterman_official_portrait_%283x4%29.jpg/120px-John_Fetterman_official_portrait_%283x4%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"102\" height=\"136\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/31/John_Fetterman_official_portrait_%283x4%29.jpg/250px-John_Fetterman_official_portrait_%283x4%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"1535\" data-file-height=\"2047\" /></a></span>\n</td>\n<td class=\"notheme\" style=\"text-align:center;border-bottom: 6px solid #E81B23;\"><span class=\"notpageimage noresize\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Dr._Mehmet_Oz,_August_2016.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f9/Dr._Mehmet_Oz%2C_August_2016.jpg/120px-Dr._Mehmet_Oz%2C_August_2016.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"97\" height=\"136\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f9/Dr._Mehmet_Oz%2C_August_2016.jpg/250px-Dr._Mehmet_Oz%2C_August_2016.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"636\" data-file-height=\"889\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:75px;text-align:left\">Nominee\n</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/John_Fetterman\" title=\"John Fetterman\">John Fetterman</a></b>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><a href=\"/wiki/Mehmet_Oz\" title=\"Mehmet Oz\">Mehmet Oz</a>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:75px;text-align:left\">Party\n</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><a href=\"/wiki/Democratic_Party_(US)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Democratic Party (US)\">Democratic</a>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><a href=\"/wiki/Republican_Party_(US)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Republican Party (US)\">Republican</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:75px;text-align:left\">Popular&#160;vote\n</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><b>2,751,012</b>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">2,487,260\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:75px;text-align:left\">Percentage\n</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><b>51.2%</b>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">46.3%\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n</tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\" class=\"infobox-full-data\"><hr /><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:2022_United_States_Senate_election_in_Pennsylvania_results_map_by_county.svg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/58/2022_United_States_Senate_election_in_Pennsylvania_results_map_by_county.svg/330px-2022_United_States_Senate_election_in_Pennsylvania_results_map_by_county.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"300\" height=\"174\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/58/2022_United_States_Senate_election_in_Pennsylvania_results_map_by_county.svg/960px-2022_United_States_Senate_election_in_Pennsylvania_results_map_by_county.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"810\" data-file-height=\"471\" /></a></span><div>County results<br /><b>Fetterman:</b> <span style=\"margin:0px; font-size:90%;\"><span style=\"border:none; background-color:#7996E2; color:#7996E2;\">&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;</span>&#160;50–60%</span> <span style=\"margin:0px; font-size:90%;\"><span style=\"border:none; background-color:#6674DE; color:#6674DE;\">&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;</span>&#160;60–70%</span> <span style=\"margin:0px; font-size:90%;\"><span style=\"border:none; background-color:#3933E5; color:#3933E5;\">&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;</span>&#160;80–90%</span><br /><b>Oz:</b> <span style=\"margin:0px; font-size:90%;\"><span style=\"border:none; background-color:#E27F7F; color:#E27F7F;\">&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;</span>&#160;50–60%</span> <span style=\"margin:0px; font-size:90%;\"><span style=\"border:none; background-color:#D75D5D; color:#D75D5D;\">&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;</span>&#160;60–70%</span> <span style=\"margin:0px; font-size:90%;\"><span style=\"border:none; background-color:#D72F30; color:#D72F30;\">&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;</span>&#160;70–80%</span> <span style=\"margin:0px; font-size:90%;\"><span style=\"border:none; background-color:#C21B18; color:#C21B18;\">&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;</span>&#160;80–90%</span></div></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\" class=\"infobox-full-data\"><hr />\n<table role=\"presentation\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"background:transparent; color: inherit; width:100%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"width:50%; text-align:left;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/List_of_United_States_senators_from_Pennsylvania\" title=\"List of United States senators from Pennsylvania\">U.S. senator</a> before election</b><br />\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/Pat_Toomey\" title=\"Pat Toomey\">Pat Toomey</a><br />\n<a href=\"/wiki/Republican_Party_(US)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Republican Party (US)\">Republican</a>\n</p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:50%; text-align:right;\"><b>Elected U.S. Senator</b> <br />\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/John_Fetterman\" title=\"John Fetterman\">John Fetterman</a><br />\n<a href=\"/wiki/Democratic_Party_(US)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Democratic Party (US)\">Democratic</a>\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table>\n<link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1368532237\" /><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote navigation-not-searchable\">Main article: <a href=\"/wiki/2022_United_States_Senate_election_in_Pennsylvania\" title=\"2022 United States Senate election in Pennsylvania\">2022 United States Senate election in Pennsylvania</a></div>\n<link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1368532237\" /><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote navigation-not-searchable\">See also: <a href=\"/wiki/List_of_United_States_senators_from_Pennsylvania\" title=\"List of United States senators from Pennsylvania\">List of United States senators from Pennsylvania</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/2022_United_States_House_of_Representatives_elections_in_Pennsylvania\" title=\"2022 United States House of Representatives elections in Pennsylvania\">2022 United States House of Representatives elections in Pennsylvania</a></div>\n<p>Two-term Republican <a href=\"/wiki/Pat_Toomey\" title=\"Pat Toomey\">Pat Toomey</a> was <a href=\"/wiki/2016_United_States_Senate_election_in_Pennsylvania\" title=\"2016 United States Senate election in Pennsylvania\">re-elected in 2016</a> with 48.8% of the vote. On October 5, 2020, Toomey announced that he would retire at the end of his term.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-toomeyretires&#95;69-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-toomeyretires-69\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>47<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</p><p>Lieutenant Governor <a href=\"/wiki/John_Fetterman\" title=\"John Fetterman\">John Fetterman</a><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-240\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-240\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>215<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> easily defeated state representative <a href=\"/wiki/Malcolm_Kenyatta\" title=\"Malcolm Kenyatta\">Malcolm Kenyatta</a> and U.S. representative <a href=\"/wiki/Conor_Lamb\" title=\"Conor Lamb\">Conor Lamb</a> in the Democratic primary.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-politico.com&#95;241-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-politico.com-241\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>216<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</p><p><a href=\"/wiki/Mehmet_Oz\" title=\"Mehmet Oz\">Mehmet Oz</a>, host of <i><a href=\"/wiki/The_Dr._Oz_Show\" title=\"The Dr. Oz Show\">The Dr. Oz Show</a></i> and <a href=\"/wiki/Cardiothoracic_surgeon\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Cardiothoracic surgeon\">cardiothoracic surgeon</a>,<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-242\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-242\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>217<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> narrowly defeated business executive <a href=\"/wiki/Dave_McCormick\" title=\"Dave McCormick\">Dave McCormick</a>, 2018 U.S. Senate candidate <a href=\"/wiki/Jeff_Bartos\" title=\"Jeff Bartos\">Jeff Bartos</a>,<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-243\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-243\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>218<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> 2018 candidate for <span data-sort-value=\"Pennsylvania07&#160;!\"><a href=\"/wiki/Pennsylvania%27s_7th_congressional_district\" title=\"Pennsylvania&#39;s 7th congressional district\">Pennsylvania's 7th congressional district</a></span> Sean Gale,<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-244\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-244\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>219<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> political commentator <a href=\"/wiki/Kathy_Barnette\" title=\"Kathy Barnette\">Kathy Barnette</a>,<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-245\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-245\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>220<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> and former <a href=\"/wiki/List_of_ambassadors_of_the_United_States_to_Denmark\" title=\"List of ambassadors of the United States to Denmark\">U.S. ambassador to Denmark</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Carla_Sands\" title=\"Carla Sands\">Carla Sands</a>,<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-246\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-246\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>221<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> after a bitter Republican primary.\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\";\">\n<caption>Pennsylvania Republican primary<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-PAprimary&#95;247-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-PAprimary-247\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>222<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</caption>\n<tbody><tr>\n<th scope=\"col\" colspan=\"2\" style=\"width: 15em\">Party\n</th>\n<th scope=\"col\" style=\"width: 17em\">Candidate\n</th>\n<th scope=\"col\" style=\"width: 5em\">Votes\n</th>\n<th scope=\"col\" style=\"width: 3.5em\">%\n</th></tr>\n\n\n<tr class=\"vcard\">\n<td style=\"color:inherit;background-color:#E81B23;width:5px\">\n</td>\n<td class=\"org\" style=\"width:130px\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/Republican_Party_(United_States)\" title=\"Republican Party (United States)\">Republican</a></b>\n</td>\n<th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-align:left; font-weight:normal; color:inherit; background:inherit;\" class=\"fn\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/Mehmet_Oz\" title=\"Mehmet Oz\">Mehmet Oz</a> </b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:right;margin-right:0.5em\"><b>420,168 </b>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right;margin-right:0.5em\"><b>31.21 <