.com/politics/former-nfl-player-iraq-war-veteran-bequette-challenges-arkansas-sen-boozman\">\"Former NFL player, Iraq war veteran Jake Bequette challenges Arkansas Sen. Boozman\"</a>. Fox News<span class=\"reference-accessdate\">. Retrieved <span class=\"nowrap\">July 12,</span> 2021</span>.</cite><span title=\"ctx&#95;ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft&#95;val&#95;fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=article&amp;rft.atitle=Former+NFL+player%2C+Iraq+war+veteran+Jake+Bequette+challenges+Arkansas+Sen.+Boozman&amp;rft.date=2021-07-12&amp;rft.au=Steinhauser%2C+Paul&amp;rft&#95;id=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.foxnews.com%2Fpolitics%2Fformer-nfl-player-iraq-war-veteran-bequette-challenges-arkansas-sen-boozman&amp;rfr&#95;id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3A2022+United+States+Senate+elections\" class=\"Z3988\"></span></span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-102\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-102\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106\" /><cite id=\"CITEREFLockwood,&#95;Frank&#95;E.2021\" class=\"citation news cs1\">Lockwood, Frank E. (March 17, 2021). <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.arkansasonline.com/news/2021/mar/17/former-gubernatorial-candidate-launches-bid-us-sen/\">\"Former gubernatorial candidate Jan Morgan launches U.S. Senate bid\"</a>. Arkansas Democrat Gazette<span class=\"reference-accessdate\">. Retrieved <span class=\"nowrap\">March 18,</span> 2021</span>.</cite><span title=\"ctx&#95;ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft&#95;val&#95;fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=article&amp;rft.atitle=Former+gubernatorial+candidate+Jan+Morgan+launches+U.S.+Senate+bid&amp;rft.date=2021-03-17&amp;rft.au=Lockwood%2C+Frank+E.&amp;rft&#95;id=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.arkansasonline.com%2Fnews%2F2021%2Fmar%2F17%2Fformer-gubernatorial-candidate-launches-bid-us-sen%2F&amp;rfr&#95;id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3A2022+United+States